Dialogue: 0,2:15:29.06,2:15:30.96,Song,NTP,0,0,0,,♪ You can't keep lettin' it Get you down ♪
Dialogue: 0,2:15:31.00,2:15:32.50,Song,NTP,0,0,0,,♪ When the morning comes ♪



Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.95,0:00:29.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝您今天愉快\N{\reng}Have a brilliant day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.88,0:00:30.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\reng}Yeah, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.53,0:00:31.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也是\N{\reng}You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.83,0:00:34.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好 想点些什么\N{\reng}Morning. What can I get you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.38,0:00:35.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那位卷发女士呢\N{\reng}Where's curly-hair lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.73,0:00:36.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨拉吗\N{\reng}Sara?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.68,0:00:39.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她生病了 反正她请假时是这么说的\N{\reng}She's out sick. Or at least, that's what she says.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.73,0:00:41.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实是交新男友了\N{\reng}She's got a new boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.44,0:00:42.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想点什么 跟我说就行\N{\reng}What can I get you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.44,0:00:43.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我通常都点一样的\N{\reng}Usually it's my usual
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.94,0:00:45.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我赶时间 她会提前备好\N{\reng}and she usually has it ready because I'm usually late.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.57,0:00:47.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就快点儿告诉我吧\N{\reng}Well, don't keep me in suspense.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.45,0:00:49.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,PB和BRHC组合三明治\N{\reng}Um, it's a PB and BRHC on a roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.77,0:00:50.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记一下\N{\reng}Okay, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.91,0:00:53.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- PB指的是花生酱 我没猜错吧 - 没错\N{\reng}-"PB" would be peanut butter, I'm assuming? -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.58,0:00:54.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,BR是香蕉 葡萄干\N{\reng}"BR," bananas, raisins.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.54,0:00:56.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,H是蜂蜜 C是奶酪\N{\reng}"H," honey. "C," cheese on a roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.29,0:00:58.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新陈代谢快的人真是有口福\N{\reng}Aren't you blessed with a fast metabolism.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.35,0:01:00.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这是要去跑马拉松吗\N{\reng}Are you running a marathon or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.22,0:01:02.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说起来 我妹妹倒是跑过一次\N{\reng}You know, my sister ran a marathon once,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.12,0:01:03.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老天保佑她\N{\reng}God rest her soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.54,0:01:05.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人没事 就是累得半死不活\N{\reng}She's not dead. She's just exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.92,0:01:07.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不就是跑了个步吗 莎伦\N{\reng}We get it, Sharon. You ran.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.17,0:01:09.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们早上都要去上班啊\N{\reng}But everyone has to work in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.92,0:01:11.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 我上班已经迟到三分钟了\N{\reng}Yeah, I have to go to work, three minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.67,0:01:13.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思 我想快点儿吃到我的三明治\N{\reng}And, sorry, I'm in sort of a rush for the sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.93,0:01:17.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老兄 心急可吃不到好三明治啊\N{\reng}You can't rush a good sandwich, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.72,0:01:22.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿尔弗雷德 等会儿说\N{\reng}Alfred, really can't talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.48,0:01:23.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好啊 艾伦先生\N{\reng}Good morning, Mr. Allen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.06,0:01:25.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好 我迟到了\N{\reng}No, I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.14,0:01:27.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且快饿死了 卷发姑娘今天不在\N{\reng}And I'm starving, and curly-haired girl isn't here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.19,0:01:28.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她叫萨拉 有男朋友\N{\reng}and her name is Sara, and she has a boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.27,0:01:30.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥谭总医院这边出乱子了\N{\reng}We have a situation at Gotham General.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.53,0:01:31.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是由抢劫引发的\N{\reng}A robbery gone wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.07,0:01:34.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在可是大白天\N{\reng}This is the middle of the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.07,0:01:36.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们那位蝙蝠朋友不是应该在睡觉吗\N{\reng}Why is our bat-friend even awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.78,0:01:37.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫超人去\N{\reng}Call Superman.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.95,0:01:39.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先想到的他\N{\reng}That was my first thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.20,0:01:40.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惜他正在忙别的事\N{\reng}Sadly, he's otherwise engaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.54,0:01:41.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是一座位于中美洲的活火山\N{\reng}...active volcano in Central America.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.41,0:01:43.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又是这样\N{\reng}Classic.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.91,0:01:44.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴安娜呢\N{\reng}What about Diana?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.79,0:01:45.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也考虑过了\N{\reng}My other first thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.04,0:01:47.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可她不接电话 我能有什么办法\N{\reng}Rather annoyingly, she's not picking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.04,0:01:49.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是找不到其他人了\N{\reng}How many first thoughts, exactly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.04,0:01:51.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才想起来找我的 是吧\N{\reng}did you have before you first thought of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.42,0:01:52.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟她有什么关系\N{\reng}...never about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.67,0:01:54.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是关乎你自己的 - 抱歉 我的三明治好了吗\N{\reng}-This is about you. -Hi, sorry. Is my sandwich...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.42,0:01:56.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去年在船上时 我算是长教训了\N{\reng}I learned my lesson on the boat last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.68,0:01:58.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的那个妹妹可真是酒后吐真言\N{\reng}Stuff my sister comes out with when she's drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.93,0:02:00.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就连对我妈妈的朋友也是一通数落\N{\reng}Personal comments about my mom's friends as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.85,0:02:02.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她居然好意思说别人\N{\reng}which I think is what I say about her...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.44,0:02:14.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\reng}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.65,0:02:15.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是闪电侠\N{\reng}Flash!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.03,0:02:16.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好\N{\reng}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.38,0:02:18.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\reng}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.66,0:02:19.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得你人也很好\N{\reng}You seem very nice also.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.03,0:02:21.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\reng}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.79,0:02:24.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让韦恩先生跟你说\N{\reng}Patching you into Mr. Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.33,0:02:25.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别 拜托\N{\reng}No, please don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.08,0:02:27.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 这么问你可能有点儿怪\N{\reng}Oh, my God. Sorry if this sounds weird,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.54,0:02:29.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个巧克力棒 你还吃吗\N{\reng}but are you actively eating that candy bar?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.54,0:02:31.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能扔给我吗\N{\reng}Maybe you could throw it to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.34,0:02:32.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以正义的名义\N{\reng}In the name of justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.42,0:02:33.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊 好啊\N{\reng}Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.30,0:02:35.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要你抓紧过来 巴里\N{\reng}I need you here now, Barry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.34,0:02:36.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨 布鲁斯\N{\reng}Hi, Bruce.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.22,0:02:37.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了 我\N{\reng}Yes, I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.55,0:02:38.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了\N{\reng}coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.16,0:03:42.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了 各部门\N{\reng}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.03,0:03:44.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\reng}No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.04,0:03:53.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布鲁斯 这里的情况简直糟透了\N{\reng}Bruce, this is a huge mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.96,0:03:55.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你人在哪儿呢\N{\reng}Why aren't you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.90,0:04:16.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布鲁斯 怎么听着像是你正在跑路啊\N{\reng}Bruce, why does it sound like you're fleeing the scene?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.07,0:04:20.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,法尔科内的傻儿子想干票大的\N{\reng}Falcone's idiot kid decided to try to play in the big leagues.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.65,0:04:23.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,召集了一伙人 闯进了哥谭总医院的实验室\N{\reng}He put a crew together and broke into the lab at Gotham General.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.66,0:04:25.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,偷走了一种致命病毒\N{\reng}Stole a highly deadly virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.78,0:04:27.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被我拦截时 他们炸开了一条出路\N{\reng}I intercepted them, but they blasted their way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.08,0:04:30.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,医院那边就靠你了 巴里\N{\reng}You can handle the hospital, Barry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.66,0:04:33.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这边还得忙着拯救世界\N{\reng}Somebody has to save the rest of the world, so I was gonna do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.08,0:04:34.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你不要介意\N{\reng}If you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.08,0:04:35.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说得很在理 布鲁斯\N{\reng}Sounds about right, Bruce.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.52,0:04:57.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你从坑里救了我 闪电侠\N{\reng}"Thanks for saving me from the sinkhole, Flash."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.69,0:04:59.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里 煤气管道和水管破裂\N{\reng}Barry, gas and water pipes ruptured.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.57,0:05:01.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在地下室\N{\reng}In the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.44,0:05:02.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了\N{\reng}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.03,0:05:05.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就去\N{\reng}On it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.67,0:05:18.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你那边能打开吗\N{\reng}Can you open it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.92,0:05:20.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像卡住了\N{\reng}-I think it's locked. -It's jammed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.71,0:05:22.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 打不开啊\N{\reng}God, it's not working!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.55,0:05:23.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\reng}Oh, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.81,0:05:35.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说 阿尔弗雷德 我已经认了\N{\reng}Look, Alfred. I've come to accept
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.90,0:05:38.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在正义联盟里就是个收拾烂摊子的角色\N{\reng}that I'm essentially the janitor of the Justice League.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.90,0:05:40.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差事虽然苦\N{\reng}Which sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.32,0:05:41.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我也认了\N{\reng}But I've come to accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.07,0:05:43.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是\N{\reng}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.32,0:05:44.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎么觉得\N{\reng}I can't help but notice...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.32,0:05:47.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每次这个烂摊子的罪魁祸首\N{\reng}that it always seems to be a bat-mess...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.16,0:05:49.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是蝙蝠侠\N{\reng}that I'm cleaning up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.30,0:06:06.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当心\N{\reng}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.40,0:07:03.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我的推算是正确的\N{\reng}If my calculations are correct,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.57,0:07:05.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从以往的经验来看 通常是正确的\N{\reng}and history will prove they usually are,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.65,0:07:07.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么地基的损毁\N{\reng}the foundational damage is
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.07,0:07:09.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将会导致整个东翼建筑的坍塌\N{\reng}about to cause the collapse of the east wing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.20,0:07:11.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,东翼没事啊\N{\reng}East wing's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.57,0:07:12.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有我在\N{\reng}All right, I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.16,0:07:15.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸好没事 我速度要跟不上了\N{\reng}Which is good because my speed is lagging.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.95,0:07:16.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还饿着肚子呢 阿尔弗雷德\N{\reng}Running on empty, Alfred.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.79,0:07:18.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听见没\N{\reng}Do you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.71,0:07:19.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的肚子在叫\N{\reng}That's my stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.80,0:07:26.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\reng}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.92,0:07:28.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是东翼坍塌的声音\N{\reng}It's the collapsing east wing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.28,0:07:47.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里 30楼\N{\reng}Barry, 30th floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.28,0:07:48.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在下\N{\reng}There's a
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.19,0:07:49.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宝宝\N{\reng}baby...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.66,0:07:51.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雨\N{\reng}Shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.65,0:10:36.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾伦先生\N{\reng}Mr. Allen,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.91,0:10:38.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我太为你感到骄傲了\N{\reng}you've made me very proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.45,0:10:41.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈们会很感激你的\N{\reng}And a lot of mothers very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.04,0:10:51.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\reng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.71,0:10:52.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\reng}I understand
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.67,0:10:55.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才发生的这一切可能会给你带来心理创伤\N{\reng}that these events can be psychologically scarring.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.47,0:10:58.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到时候你可以找心理咨询师寻求帮助\N{\reng}You should seek the services of a mental health professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.59,0:11:01.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这方面 正义联盟暂时做得还不够好\N{\reng}The Justice League is not very good at that part yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.60,0:11:02.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\reng}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.93,0:11:03.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\reng}God.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.47,0:11:44.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快甩掉他\N{\reng}Shake him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.52,0:12:34.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是让那个公文包掉进水里\N{\reng}If that briefcase falls into the water,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.07,0:12:38.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,午饭前就可能有一半的哥谭市民丧命\N{\reng}it could wipe out half of Gotham by lunchtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.15,0:12:42.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\reng}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.53,0:12:43.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别松手啊\N{\reng}Please don't drop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.91,0:12:46.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 求你了 千万别松手啊\N{\reng}Oh, God, no. Please, please don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.54,0:12:55.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 来晚了\N{\reng}Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.93,0:13:02.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心台阶\N{\reng}Watch your step.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.56,0:13:08.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行头不错嘛\N{\reng}Nice suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.06,0:13:10.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很帅嘛 闪电侠\N{\reng}Looking good, Flash.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.85,0:13:11.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢\N{\reng}Oh, uh... Thank... Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.69,0:13:14.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至于你\N{\reng}And you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.27,0:13:16.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用谢我\N{\reng}are welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.40,0:13:19.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我天性自负 从来不会跟别人道谢\N{\reng}My ego's far too big to say "thank you" to someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.15,0:13:24.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把自己塑造成个狠角色\N{\reng}I developed this... all-powerful persona
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.66,0:13:26.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是为了弥补童年创伤\N{\reng}to compensate for my childhood trauma...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.53,0:13:28.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也有童年创伤\N{\reng}I, too, have childhood trauma.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.16,0:13:30.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真言套索\N{\reng}The Lasso of Truth...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.41,0:13:32.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总是很灵\N{\reng}...never gets old.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.46,0:13:34.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还不如把自己的钱都捐出去\N{\reng}I'd do a lot better just giving all my money away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.42,0:13:36.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,消除犯罪的本质在于消除贫困\N{\reng}Yes, if I really wanted to end crime, I should end poverty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.04,0:13:38.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我了解什么是亲热\N{\reng}I know sex exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.55,0:13:40.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是从没体验过而已\N{\reng}I've just never experienced it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.67,0:13:42.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\reng}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.92,0:13:43.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想\N{\reng}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.18,0:13:45.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我该走了\N{\reng}I have to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.47,0:13:46.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\reng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.18,0:13:48.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用客气\N{\reng}Always a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.31,0:13:53.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚才只是想打个比方\N{\reng}The sex thing was a metaphor...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.56,0:13:55.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想比喻的是哥特文学\N{\reng}for gothic literature.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.90,0:13:57.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本就圆不回来了\N{\reng}There was just no way to recover from that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.31,0:13:58.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别想了\N{\reng}Just let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.90,0:14:02.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个 我很想继续帮你收拾烂摊子\N{\reng}Well, I'd really love to stay and clean up more mess...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.57,0:14:04.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我这个小超级英雄得去吃早饭了\N{\reng}but this little superhero needs his breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.78,0:14:05.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见 闪电侠\N{\reng}Goodbye, Flash.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.66,0:14:07.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 再见 蝙蝠侠\N{\reng}Yeah. Bye, Batman.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.03,0:14:10.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,漂亮 韦恩先生\N{\reng}Well done, Mr. Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.95,0:14:12.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回家吃早饭吗 先生\N{\reng}Will you be home for breakfast, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.21,0:14:17.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 我看行\N{\reng}Yes, I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.96,0:14:21.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只会自取灭亡\N{\reng}...the road to destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.30,0:14:23.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟她有什么关系\N{\reng}This was never about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.21,0:14:24.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你自己的人生\N{\reng}This is about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.05,0:14:27.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个人不能总是活在过去\N{\reng}You have to stop living in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.05,0:14:29.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样 我做得够快了吧\N{\reng}Now, was that fast enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.15,0:14:43.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看谁来了\N{\reng}Ah, look who's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.19,0:14:44.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴 阿尔伯特\N{\reng}Shut up, Albert.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.69,0:14:45.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,整天迟到\N{\reng}Every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.57,0:14:47.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么做到的 巴里\N{\reng}I don't know how you do it, Barry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.20,0:14:48.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是爬着来的吗 老兄\N{\reng}What'd you, like, crawl here, bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.66,0:14:49.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他生气了吗\N{\reng}Is he mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.53,0:14:50.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你饭碗要不保了\N{\reng}Well, you're getting fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.66,0:14:51.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小命都不保了\N{\reng}You're getting murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.58,0:14:52.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先别解释\N{\reng}Oh, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.54,0:14:53.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我猜猜\N{\reng}Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.08,0:14:55.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的闹钟没有响\N{\reng}Your alarm clock didn't go off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.79,0:14:58.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不对 - 你的狗把闹钟吃了\N{\reng}-No-- -Oh, your dog ate your alarm clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.67,0:15:00.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的闹钟把你的钥匙吃了\N{\reng}Your alarm clock ate your keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.67,0:15:02.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,钥匙的奶奶去世了\N{\reng}Your keys' grandmother died,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.30,0:15:03.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以它们都要请假\N{\reng}and they need a personal day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.55,0:15:04.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那倒不至于\N{\reng}It was none of those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.71,0:15:05.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次又有什么借口 巴里\N{\reng}What was it this time, Barry?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.92,0:15:07.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是有事耽搁了\N{\reng}It was, um, something else
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.93,0:15:09.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但没您说的那么离谱\N{\reng}that was far less outlandish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.68,0:15:10.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道我没赶上开会\N{\reng}And I know I missed the meeting...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.68,0:15:13.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我还是想提交这些案件 看看能否再调查一下\N{\reng}but I'd still really like to present these case files for potential review.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.06,0:15:15.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认为这些案件处理得太仓促了\N{\reng}I think we rushed these cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.35,0:15:16.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 需要重新调查取证 - 仓促\N{\reng}-We need to reopen them. -Oh! Rushed?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.23,0:15:18.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已经积压了六个月的案件\N{\reng}We got a backlog six months deep,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.73,0:15:20.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你居然还想再慢一些吗\N{\reng}and you want us to move slower?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.19,0:15:22.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,专注在那些要上庭的案件上\N{\reng}You need to focus your motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.40,0:15:24.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把手上的活儿干完 结案 然后继续\N{\reng}Do the work, close the case, move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.03,0:15:28.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你其实很有潜力 巴里\N{\reng}You have a lot of potential, Barry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.95,0:15:31.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么多年了 给我倒咖啡这种事早就不该你来做了\N{\reng}You shouldn't still be getting me coffee after all these years.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.95,0:15:34.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 您说得对\N{\reng}You're right. That's... That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.70,0:15:35.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去给我倒杯咖啡\N{\reng}Go get me a coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.83,0:15:40.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两块方糖 不然呢\N{\reng}Two sugars? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.33,0:15:41.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\reng}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.06,0:15:56.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快来听好消息\N{\reng}You're gonna love this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.18,0:15:58.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我对约翰逊一案的裁决感到满意\N{\reng}I'm very satisfied with the ruling in the Johnson case.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.43,0:16:01.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由我们的实验室所参与分析的证据\N{\reng}The evidence our lab analyzed...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.15,0:16:04.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,足以给出充分的证明\N{\reng}was more than sufficient to be conclusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.52,0:16:05.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些证据我还没分析完呢\N{\reng}-I'm still working that evidence. -Because of the diligence
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.94,0:16:09.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而这要归功于我们工作人员的 辛勤付出和高度专注\N{\reng}and hard work and focus...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.40,0:16:12.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些证据巴里还没分析完呢\N{\reng}Barry was still working on that evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.28,0:16:13.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是都听你的\N{\reng}Think if it were up to you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.58,0:16:15.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,几十年前的杀人犯到现在都没法定罪\N{\reng}that we'd still be scraping Ted Bundy's molars.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.04,0:16:19.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我告诉你们 你们或许觉得这样的事情好笑\N{\reng}You know what? I'm so happy you find this all so hilarious,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.66,0:16:22.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们经手的可都是关乎人命的\N{\reng}but we are dealing with real people's lives,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.17,0:16:23.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们可都有家庭\N{\reng}people's families.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.17,0:16:25.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们根本认识不到事情的严重性\N{\reng}And I don't think you can grasp the gravity of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.30,0:16:26.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 别烦我了 行吗\N{\reng}So, why don't you leave me alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.96,0:16:28.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里艾伦\N{\reng}Barry Allen?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.46,0:16:29.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾瑞斯韦斯特\N{\reng}Iris West.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.72,0:16:30.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你\N{\reng}You...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.05,0:16:33.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也知道我的全名\N{\reng}know my full name also.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.30,0:16:35.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是校友嘛\N{\reng}Yes, from school.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.47,0:16:37.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里 原来你还有学校的朋友啊\N{\reng}Aw, Barry, you didn't tell us you had a friend from school.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.35,0:16:39.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都不知道他居然还有朋友\N{\reng}We actually didn't know that Barry had a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.43,0:16:40.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 算算他有多少朋友\N{\reng}Yeah, what does that make it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.60,0:16:41.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个\N{\reng}One?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.56,0:16:42.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个 对\N{\reng}One.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.77,0:16:44.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们俩真是\N{\reng}You guys are so...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.77,0:16:46.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见 二位 好吧 再见\N{\reng}Um, bye, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.57,0:16:47.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了 我的天啊\N{\reng}Okay. Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.65,0:16:52.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和他们俩并不熟 只是同事而已\N{\reng}That was just... They're not really my friends. They're my work friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.07,0:16:53.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在这儿工作\N{\reng}Do you work here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.41,0:16:54.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 没错\N{\reng}Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.78,0:16:56.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的好久没见了吧\N{\reng}God, it's been a long time, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.45,0:17:00.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我之前好像在哪儿见过你\N{\reng}I feel like we saw each other...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.04,0:17:02.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就前两年 对吗\N{\reng}like a few years ago, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.96,0:17:04.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有 因为\N{\reng}No, because...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.54,0:17:06.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们上一次见面还是在\N{\reng}we haven't seen each other since...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.09,0:17:08.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大学时\N{\reng}college.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.09,0:17:11.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也可能就是我想见你\N{\reng}Maybe I was just thinking about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.55,0:17:14.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管怎样 很高兴能再遇到你\N{\reng}Well, I'm really glad I ran into you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.97,0:17:16.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 是啊\N{\reng}-Yeah. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.35,0:17:18.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你父亲的案子明天重审 对吧\N{\reng}Your father's appeal is tomorrow, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.47,0:17:20.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 你怎么\N{\reng}Yeah. How...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.18,0:17:22.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 你是怎么知道的\N{\reng}Sorry, how do you know about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.94,0:17:24.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在报社负责这篇报道\N{\reng}I'm covering it for the paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.90,0:17:27.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你父亲还好吗\N{\reng}How is he holding up?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.94,0:17:31.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是采访的问题吗\N{\reng}Are you asking for the paper?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.44,0:17:33.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 是我作为朋友关心一下\N{\reng}No, I'm asking as a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.78,0:17:36.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我想公众肯定也会感兴趣的\N{\reng}Although I'm sure the public would want to know as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.29,0:17:40.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\reng}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.29,0:17:43.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只能告诉你 我爸爸是被冤枉的\N{\reng}my only official comment is that my dad is innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.21,0:17:44.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然\N{\reng}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.33,0:17:45.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说 没有人\N{\reng}I mean, no one...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.21,0:17:48.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愿意相信自己的父亲会杀害自己的母亲\N{\reng}would want to believe that their father killed their mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.96,0:17:51.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么叫相信 我爸爸根本就不该坐牢\N{\reng}What do you mean, "believe"? My dad shouldn't be in jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.05,0:17:53.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我妈妈也该活得好好的\N{\reng}My mom should be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.22,0:17:54.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与我信不信无关\N{\reng}It's not about what I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.55,0:17:55.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实就是事实\N{\reng}It's about what the truth is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.68,0:17:57.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然 不 我是说\N{\reng}Right. No, yes, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.68,0:17:59.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 我本来就是这个意思\N{\reng}Oh, my God. That's what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.85,0:18:00.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\reng}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.06,0:18:03.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 关于此案 我现在无可奉告\N{\reng}Sorry, I have no official comment at this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.17,0:18:28.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您有一通来自铁山监狱的\N{\reng}You have a collect call
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.96,0:18:30.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对方付费电话\N{\reng}from the Iron Heights Penitentiary.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.71,0:18:31.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请问是否要接听\N{\reng}Do you wish to accept?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.84,0:18:32.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接听\N{\reng}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.92,0:18:34.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 爸爸\N{\reng}Hey, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.80,0:18:35.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 巴里\N{\reng}Hey, Barry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.80,0:18:36.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你最近好吗\N{\reng}How ya doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.93,0:18:37.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挺好的\N{\reng}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.93,0:18:38.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有多出去走走吗\N{\reng}You getting out much?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.05,0:18:40.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有啊\N{\reng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.18,0:18:40.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 没有\N{\reng}Well, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.18,0:18:42.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有\N{\reng}Uh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.68,0:18:45.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过我碰到了一个大学时的朋友\N{\reng}But I, um, I ran into an old college friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.94,0:18:47.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾瑞斯韦斯特 就今天\N{\reng}Iris West, today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.60,0:18:49.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她不是你上学时的女神吗\N{\reng}Didn't you have a monster crush on her?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.77,0:18:51.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她现在有男朋友吗\N{\reng}Well, she have a boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.15,0:18:52.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么不约她出去\N{\reng}Why don't you ask her out?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.65,0:18:54.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸 我\N{\reng}Dad, I, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.15,0:18:59.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有个朋友帮忙 修复了那家超市以前的监控录像\N{\reng}I had a friend run the old security camera footage from the store...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.20,0:19:01.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用的是他研究的新程序\N{\reng}through this new program he's developed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.78,0:19:03.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在的画面很清晰\N{\reng}And it's crystal clear now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.08,0:19:05.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是\N{\reng}It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.29,0:19:08.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一直没抬头 爸爸\N{\reng}you never look up, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.58,0:19:10.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看不见你的脸\N{\reng}You can't see your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.67,0:19:14.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以就没有新证据来支持你的不在场证明\N{\reng}So, without new evidence to support your alibi...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.42,0:19:17.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕得开始研究下一次怎么上诉了\N{\reng}we're just gonna need to start thinking about the next appeal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.68,0:19:18.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 行了\N{\reng}No, uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.59,0:19:21.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别再惦记着你老爸的事了\N{\reng}You need to stop worrying about your old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.31,0:19:25.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样你才能有时间交女朋友啊\N{\reng}Do that, you might actually have time for a girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.43,0:19:27.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 爸爸 我不想\N{\reng}But Dad, I don't want...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.69,0:19:29.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这条老路我们走过\N{\reng}We've done this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.10,0:19:30.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这已经是最后的努力了\N{\reng}This was a last-ditch effort...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.52,0:19:32.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天就当是再走走过场\N{\reng}and we'll go through the motions tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.19,0:19:35.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸没事 真的\N{\reng}I'm okay, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.32,0:19:36.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我说 我有时候觉得\N{\reng}You know, sometimes I even think
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.65,0:19:39.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在牢里待着 反而对我来说更容易一些\N{\reng}it's probably easier for me to be in here
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.16,0:19:40.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比起外面\N{\reng}than out there...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.28,0:19:42.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她不在了\N{\reng}without her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.54,0:19:45.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这儿还能有个念想 想象她还活着\N{\reng}'Cause this way, I can imagine she's alive...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.66,0:19:48.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好地过日子\N{\reng}out there living her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.42,0:19:52.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里\N{\reng}Barry?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.92,0:19:54.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里\N{\reng}Barry?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.80,0:19:56.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还在吗\N{\reng}You there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.42,0:19:58.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在呢 爸爸\N{\reng}Yeah, I'm here, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.05,0:20:01.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还记得她周日常做的那个酱汁吗\N{\reng}Hey, remember that sauce she'd make on Sundays?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.68,0:20:05.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,满屋子都是罗勒草和西红柿的香味\N{\reng}The whole house would smell like basil, tomatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.56,0:20:08.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她还喜欢穿我的衣服 边跳边唱\N{\reng}And she'd put on my sweats and start singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.52,0:20:12.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 什么歌来着\N{\reng}Yeah, what was that song?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.40,0:20:14.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢那首歌\N{\reng}I loved that song.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.02,0:20:16.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,牢记这些\N{\reng}Remember that part.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.07,0:20:23.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不合理啊\N{\reng}It's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.53,0:20:25.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么不合理 小猴子\N{\reng}What's not fair, Monkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.16,0:20:27.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这道题出得太蠢了\N{\reng}This question is stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.58,0:20:30.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能想出多少种计算结果为24的算法\N{\reng}How many calculations can you think of with an answer of 24?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.79,0:20:32.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这有无数种答案啊\N{\reng}There are a bajillion answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.42,0:20:33.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这怎么写得完啊\N{\reng}How am I supposed to fit them all?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.67,0:20:34.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说得没错\N{\reng}You are right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.59,0:20:37.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个问题确实有无数种答案\N{\reng}There are a bajillion answers to this question.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.42,0:20:39.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有的问题注定无解\N{\reng}Not every problem has a solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.80,0:20:41.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时候你得学会放弃\N{\reng}Sometimes you just have to let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.72,0:20:44.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让小脑瓜休息一下 来帮我做意面\N{\reng}Give your brain a rest and help me make the pasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.85,0:20:45.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快来\N{\reng}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.93,0:20:48.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\reng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.68,0:20:50.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亨利\N{\reng}Henry?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.31,0:20:53.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要你帮我一个忙\N{\reng}I need you to do me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.81,0:20:55.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不爱帮忙\N{\reng}I don't do favors.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.15,0:20:55.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\reng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.02,0:20:57.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实是巴里需要你帮忙\N{\reng}Barry needs you to do him a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.19,0:20:59.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里啊 那没问题\N{\reng}Oh, Barry! Yeah, anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.40,0:21:02.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还需要一罐西红柿\N{\reng}I need another can of tomatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.53,0:21:04.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是有吗\N{\reng}You have a can of tomatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.66,0:21:05.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还需要一罐\N{\reng}I need another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.83,0:21:07.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们早上不是去超市了吗\N{\reng}I thought you guys went to the store this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.29,0:21:09.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我忘买西红柿了\N{\reng}But I forgot the tomatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.54,0:21:13.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我倒是有个更好的主意\N{\reng}This looks way more fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.08,0:21:14.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不如让巴里去一趟超市\N{\reng}Let's just let Barry go to the store.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.96,0:21:16.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会开车 对吧 小鬼\N{\reng}You drive, right, Squirm?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.46,0:21:17.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 当然不会 - 你都这么大了\N{\reng}-What? No. -Getting so big.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.92,0:21:19.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定没问题 看看你\N{\reng}You can do anything. Look at ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.84,0:21:21.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至都有白头发了\N{\reng}You're getting gray, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.22,0:21:23.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,买绿皮罐头的 别买成蓝皮的 好吗\N{\reng}Green can, not the blue one, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.18,0:21:23.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了\N{\reng}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.05,0:21:25.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,买蓝皮罐头的 别买成绿皮的 对吧\N{\reng}Blue can, not the green one, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.85,0:21:26.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,错了\N{\reng}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.80,0:21:28.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 是绿皮的 不是蓝皮的\N{\reng}Green can, not the blue one. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.93,0:21:30.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完蛋了\N{\reng}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.73,0:21:34.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她要开始唱歌了\N{\reng}She's gonna start singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.65,0:21:35.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\reng}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.27,0:21:37.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里 快跑\N{\reng}Run, Barry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.04,0:21:57.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你 小猴子\N{\reng}I love you, Monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.17,0:21:58.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你更多\N{\reng}I love you more.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.80,0:22:00.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你更早\N{\reng}I loved you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.90,0:22:18.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诺拉\N{\reng}Nora?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.03,0:22:22.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里\N{\reng}Barry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.28,0:22:30.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里\N{\reng}Barry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.45,0:22:31.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里\N{\reng}Barry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.70,0:22:33.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快打急救电话 快\N{\reng}Call 911 now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.67,0:22:45.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里\N{\reng}Barry?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.43,0:22:47.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里\N{\reng}Barry?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.93,0:22:49.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别为明天担心了\N{\reng}Don't worry about tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.93,0:22:51.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们早就知道机会渺茫\N{\reng}We always knew it was a long shot...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.47,0:22:53.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\reng}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.60,0:22:58.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您与来自铁山监狱的通话已结束\N{\reng}Your call with Iron Heights Penitentiary has been terminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.67,0:24:45.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里艾伦\N{\reng}Barry Allen?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.47,0:24:51.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由我们的实验室\N{\reng}...evidence our lab...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.59,0:24:53.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,专注在那些要上庭的案件上\N{\reng}You need to focus your motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.43,0:24:54.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把手上的活儿干完 结案\N{\reng}Do the work...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.06,0:25:05.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样 我做得够快了吧\N{\reng}Now, was that fast enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.44,0:25:47.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说 你回到了过去\N{\reng}So, you're saying you went back in time?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.07,0:25:49.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像在波扎尔诺夫那次\N{\reng}Like in Pozharnov?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.07,0:25:51.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 只不过那次只有一秒钟左右\N{\reng}Yeah, like in Pozharnov, except, but Pozharnov was a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.90,0:25:53.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而这次我回溯了一整天的时间\N{\reng}This time I went back a whole day.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.45,0:25:54.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们就假设\N{\reng}So, let's imagine...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.66,0:25:57.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的确有可能跑得足够快\N{\reng}that it is, in fact, possible for you to run...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.70,0:25:59.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比光速还要快\N{\reng}faster than the speed of light...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.41,0:26:01.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通过那么做 你能回到过去\N{\reng}and in so doing, travel back in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.54,0:26:03.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是那么做\N{\reng}It still would be...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.71,0:26:05.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很不负责任\N{\reng}wildly irresponsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.58,0:26:06.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,料到你会这么说\N{\reng}I knew you were gonna say this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.67,0:26:07.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\reng}Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.54,0:26:09.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里 因为如果你回到过去\N{\reng}because, Barry, if you were to go into the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.71,0:26:12.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和你父母或是你自己的任何互动\N{\reng}any interaction you have with your parents or yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.59,0:26:14.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪怕只是走错一步路\N{\reng}you step on the wrong blade of grass,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.09,0:26:16.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都有可能产生你根本想象不到的严重后果\N{\reng}you have no idea what the consequences to that could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.84,0:26:18.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道 蝴蝶效应 对吧\N{\reng}No, I know. The butterfly effect, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.81,0:26:19.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N{\reng}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.68,0:26:20.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我懂\N{\reng}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.68,0:26:22.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 布鲁斯 我能解决问题\N{\reng}But Bruce... I could fix things.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.98,0:26:25.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同时你也可能毁灭一切\N{\reng}You could also destroy everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.56,0:26:27.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能救她\N{\reng}I could save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.69,0:26:30.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能让他俩都得救 甚至\N{\reng}I could save both of them. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.07,0:26:34.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还能救你的父母\N{\reng}I could save your parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.03,0:26:37.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里 正是这些伤痕\N{\reng}Barry, these scars we have...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.28,0:26:39.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,造就了我们\N{\reng}make us who we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.58,0:26:42.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要想着去修复它们\N{\reng}We're not meant to go back and fix them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.29,0:26:47.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在的你很好 不需要去修复什么\N{\reng}And there's nothing broken with you that needs to be fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.54,0:26:52.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就听我这个过来人的经验之谈吧\N{\reng}Take it from an old guy who's made a lot of mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.84,0:26:54.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要活在过去\N{\reng}Don't live your past.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.55,0:26:56.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,活好当下\N{\reng}Live your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.55,0:26:59.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要让悲剧定义你\N{\reng}Don't let your tragedy define you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.80,0:27:01.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我注定要被定义呢\N{\reng}What if it's supposed to define me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.56,0:27:05.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悲剧让你成了英雄\N{\reng}Your tragedy made you a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.06,0:27:07.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也让我孤身一人\N{\reng}And also made me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.44,0:27:12.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不有我吗\N{\reng}We could hang out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.57,0:27:14.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不去吃点儿东西\N{\reng}I mean, do you wanna get a bite?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.15,0:27:16.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还是很饿\N{\reng}Like, I'm still hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.78,0:27:18.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次就算了吧\N{\reng}Not this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.41,0:27:21.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下次再说吧\N{\reng}Maybe some other time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.04,0:27:25.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\reng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.05,0:27:37.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,车不错嘛\N{\reng}Nice ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.22,0:27:39.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你朋友很有钱嘛\N{\reng}You have fancy friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.30,0:27:41.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我叫的网约车\N{\reng}Yeah, it was an Uber.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.56,0:27:43.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高端网约车\N{\reng}Exec.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.81,0:27:46.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾瑞斯 我真不能和你聊案子的事\N{\reng}Look, Iris, I really can't talk about the case at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.31,0:27:48.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我此刻是朋友 不是记者\N{\reng}I'm not here as a reporter.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.40,0:27:51.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能聊聊吗\N{\reng}Can we talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.15,0:27:58.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请进\N{\reng}Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.33,0:28:06.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说实话 你这里比我想的整洁多了\N{\reng}I'm not gonna lie. It's a lot tidier in here than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.58,0:28:07.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\reng}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.46,0:28:08.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是\N{\reng}Yeah, well, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.33,0:28:11.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那好吧 我是个很爱干净的人\N{\reng}Yeah. I'm a pretty tidy person.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.42,0:28:17.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喝点儿东西吗\N{\reng}Can I offer you a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.42,0:28:18.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\reng}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.42,0:28:19.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来瓶啤酒吧\N{\reng}I'll take a beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.69,0:28:36.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啤酒 啤酒 啤酒\N{\reng}Beers, beers, beers.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.19,0:28:37.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就放在冰箱里\N{\reng}I keep 'em in my fridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.03,0:28:39.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\reng}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.40,0:28:40.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,客气\N{\reng}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.91,0:28:44.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个 对于我之前说的那些话\N{\reng}Look, I feel really bad
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.41,0:28:45.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很过意不去\N{\reng}about earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.67,0:28:52.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我应该考虑到你的心情\N{\reng}I should've been more sensitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.21,0:28:57.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也许也不该那么敏感的\N{\reng}And, um, I probably could've been less sensitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.80,0:28:59.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我无法想象你都经历了什么\N{\reng}I mean, I can't imagine what you've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.43,0:29:03.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,几乎在同一天失去了双亲\N{\reng}It's like you lost both parents in one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.80,0:29:04.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,的确是\N{\reng}I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.43,0:29:06.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,母亲死于一场悲剧\N{\reng}I lost my mom to a tragedy,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.85,0:29:09.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而司法系统的漏洞又让我失去了父亲\N{\reng}and I lost my dad to the failures of the justice system.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.31,0:29:12.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你去了刑事取证部门\N{\reng}Is that why you got into criminal forensics?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.06,0:29:14.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,试图修复司法系统\N{\reng}To try and fix the system?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.53,0:29:18.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\reng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.28,0:29:20.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 修复\N{\reng}Yeah, to fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.28,0:29:23.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定有办法修复 对吧\N{\reng}There's gotta be a way to fix it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.28,0:29:26.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实这也是我从事新闻业的原因\N{\reng}I mean, that's kinda why I got into journalism, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.04,0:29:28.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要我能回到过去 我就能找到办法\N{\reng}I could make it right if I could just go back somehow
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.91,0:29:32.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在他们不知情的状态下 给他们警告\N{\reng}and warn them without them knowing that I'd warned them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.29,0:29:34.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这么想\N{\reng}I... thinking like that's gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.67,0:29:35.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会把自己逼疯的\N{\reng}...drive you crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.34,0:29:37.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我能回到过去\N{\reng}"If I could just go back in time...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.05,0:29:39.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阻止凶手行凶就好了 这\N{\reng}and stop the guy who did it." It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.30,0:29:41.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 要是那么做 动静就太大了\N{\reng}No, I can't do that, 'cause that's way too much interaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.68,0:29:45.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爸爸当时根本就不在家\N{\reng}My dad wasn't even at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.93,0:29:48.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我妈妈让他去买西红柿了\N{\reng}My mom sent him to go get a can of tomatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.60,0:29:50.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当年那个歹徒可能以为家里没人\N{\reng}I think whoever broke into the house thought it was empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.93,0:29:52.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直到看见了我妈妈 她手里有刀\N{\reng}And then my mom was in there with the knife in her hand
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.98,0:29:56.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,于是情况变糟 看似荒谬的事接连发生\N{\reng}and things went bad, just this absurd chain of events.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.81,0:30:00.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这段录像本应成为我爸爸的不在场证明的\N{\reng}And it's like, this footage should've finally supported my dad's alibi.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.15,0:30:01.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然而却\N{\reng}But instead...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.65,0:30:04.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一罐西红柿毁了三个人的一生\N{\reng}three lives ruined for a can of tomatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.29,0:30:12.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\reng}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.66,0:30:13.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么\N{\reng}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.08,0:30:16.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有突破点了\N{\reng}Well, that could be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.79,0:30:18.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是妈妈没忘买西红柿\N{\reng}If my mom doesn't forget the tomatoes in the first place,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.55,0:30:20.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸就不会出门 妈妈也就不会死\N{\reng}then he never leaves and she never dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.96,0:30:22.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不需要露面\N{\reng}No one would even have to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.80,0:30:25.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样也就没有布鲁斯说的互动\N{\reng}Bruce said no interaction. This is no interaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.30,0:30:26.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以快进快出\N{\reng}This is just quick in, quick out,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.68,0:30:28.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回到现在 跟从来没回去过一样\N{\reng}back to the present, like I was never even there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.30,0:30:30.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这么办 天啊 艾瑞斯\N{\reng}That's how I fix it. Oh, my God, Iris.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.18,0:30:31.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太感谢你了\N{\reng}Thank you, so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.81,0:30:33.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太好了\N{\reng}This has been great.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.69,0:30:34.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实在抱歉\N{\reng}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.06,0:30:37.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得走了\N{\reng}I... I have to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.77,0:30:39.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 好\N{\reng}Okay. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.53,0:30:43.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 聊得很开心 改天再约\N{\reng}I had a really great time, by the way. We should do this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.92,0:31:01.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡尔-艾尔 氪星之子\N{\reng}Kal-El, son of Krypton.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.84,0:31:03.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个主意糟透了\N{\reng}This is a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.80,0:31:05.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个主意糟透了\N{\reng}This is a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.43,0:31:07.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个主意糟透了\N{\reng}This is a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.31,0:31:11.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来你很快\N{\reng}So, you're fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.10,0:31:16.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你爸爸是个杀人犯\N{\reng}Your dad's a murderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.48,0:31:17.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你爸爸是个杀人犯\N{\reng}Your dad's a murderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.90,0:31:23.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快打急救电话 快\N{\reng}Call 911 now!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.07,0:31:25.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快\N{\reng}...now!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.28,0:31:27.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快\N{\reng}...now!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.91,0:31:29.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快\N{\reng}...now!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.79,0:32:22.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨 妈妈\N{\reng}Hi, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.60,0:32:37.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别忘了这罐西红柿\N{\reng}Don't forget the tomatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.56,0:32:40.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回头见\N{\reng}See you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.90,0:32:49.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要成功啊\N{\reng}Please work.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.41,0:33:00.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝你生日快乐\N{\reng}? Happy Birthday, dear... ?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.54,0:33:03.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生日快乐 巴里\N{\reng}Happy Birthday, Barry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.30,0:33:11.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 加油 巴里 冲啊 - 加油\N{\reng}- Go, Barry, hurry up. - Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.30,0:33:15.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,2013届的毕业生们 祝你们毕业快乐\N{\reng}Congratulations to the class of 2013!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.68,0:33:21.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好爱你 妈妈好爱你\N{\reng}I love you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.17,0:34:26.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小猴子\N{\reng}Monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.84,0:34:29.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你穿的什么呀\N{\reng}What are you wearing?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.71,0:34:32.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里回来了 这么早\N{\reng}Is that Barry? And he's early?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.80,0:34:34.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太阳打西边出来了\N{\reng}What universe is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.55,0:34:36.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你剪头发了\N{\reng}You've cut your hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.55,0:34:38.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这下能看见眼睛了\N{\reng}Now you can see your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.10,0:34:40.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么变丑了\N{\reng}You look terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.22,0:34:41.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亨利\N{\reng}Henry!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.18,0:34:42.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 看着老了 - 我儿子多帅啊\N{\reng}-You look old. -You look beautiful, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.93,0:34:44.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在学校到底经历了什么\N{\reng}What are they doing to you over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.44,0:34:46.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说了 我儿子多棒啊\N{\reng}Leave him alone. He's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.06,0:34:49.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来 抱抱\N{\reng}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.03,0:34:53.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好爱你\N{\reng}I love you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.32,0:34:54.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也爱你\N{\reng}I love you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.28,0:34:56.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你更多\N{\reng}I love you more.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.53,0:34:58.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你更早\N{\reng}I loved you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.78,0:35:00.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去洗个澡 换身衣服\N{\reng}Go take a shower and change.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.66,0:35:02.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一身臭鞋子味儿\N{\reng}You smell like a boot.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.16,0:35:03.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去 快去\N{\reng}Go, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.54,0:35:06.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老了\N{\reng}"Old,"
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.46,0:35:07.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真有你的\N{\reng}seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.54,0:35:09.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 我是说成熟了\N{\reng}Well, no, I mean like mature.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.21,0:35:11.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他这个年纪 看着成熟点儿好\N{\reng}He's at that age, he wants to look old.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.17,0:35:13.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如 能混进酒吧\N{\reng}He, you know, gets into bars that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.67,0:35:14.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要帮忙吗\N{\reng}How can I help?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.31,0:35:22.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈 今天过得好吗\N{\reng}Hey, Mom, how was your day?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.56,0:35:25.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个月 还有过去18年 都还好吗\N{\reng}How was your month, or your last 18 years?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.69,0:35:26.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好奇怪的问题\N{\reng}Or that's a weird question...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.10,0:35:28.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我也在\N{\reng}'cause I was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.10,0:35:31.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很明显 这些事我应该都记得才对\N{\reng}But obviously, we share those memories together.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.27,0:35:33.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不 我们去创造些新的回忆\N{\reng}Or I don't know, maybe we could make some new memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.07,0:35:34.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如去水族馆 或者马戏团\N{\reng}Like we could go to the aquarium, or the circus,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.78,0:35:36.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公园也行 你们可以推我荡秋千\N{\reng}or to the park and you could push me on a swing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.82,0:35:38.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也好奇怪 因为我已经是成年人了\N{\reng}That's also weird because I'm an adult now,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.91,0:35:40.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全可以自己荡秋千了\N{\reng}so I'd probably motivate my own motion on a swing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.91,0:35:42.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 这周在学校过得怎么样啊\N{\reng}So, how was it this week? How's school?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.29,0:35:47.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在学校 我过得好着呢\N{\reng}At school was... is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.33,0:35:49.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切都好\N{\reng}School's been great.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.29,0:35:51.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有好好学习 学我的那些\N{\reng}I've just been working really hard there on my...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.09,0:35:52.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,专业课\N{\reng}studies.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.05,0:35:54.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约经济学课上那个姑娘了吗\N{\reng}Did you ask out that girl from econ?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.96,0:35:57.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道大一新生通常应该\N{\reng}I know freshman year is about
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.47,0:35:59.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多参加活动 结识新朋友\N{\reng}going out, meeting people, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.93,0:36:01.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有多探索\N{\reng}Exploring things.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.80,0:36:03.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多尝试新鲜事物\N{\reng}Experimenting.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.85,0:36:07.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 还是要多谨慎一点儿\N{\reng}But you have to be very careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.85,0:36:08.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了\N{\reng}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.31,0:36:12.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我突然想上厕所\N{\reng}I... have to shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.53,0:36:14.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去了\N{\reng}Outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.28,0:36:22.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命\N{\reng}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.28,0:36:23.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么在这儿\N{\reng}Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.29,0:36:25.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今年是哪年\N{\reng}What year is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.29,0:36:28.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别乱动 - 救命\N{\reng}-No, no, no. -Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.92,0:36:35.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我的脸\N{\reng}That's my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.71,0:36:37.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你偷了我的脸\N{\reng}You stole my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.05,0:36:39.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是致幻蘑菇导致的吗\N{\reng}Think I'm having a mushroom flashback?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.43,0:36:40.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有可能吗\N{\reng}Is that a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.34,0:36:41.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你多大了\N{\reng}How old are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.80,0:36:44.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,18岁\N{\reng}Eighteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.15,0:36:56.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这也太魔幻了\N{\reng}This is mad trippy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.69,0:36:58.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们这是在未来\N{\reng}So, we're, like, in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.19,0:36:59.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 等一下\N{\reng}No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.07,0:37:00.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一点儿也不魔幻 老弟\N{\reng}This is not trippy, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.03,0:37:02.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简直是飞来横祸\N{\reng}This is catastrophic.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.28,0:37:03.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这也不是未来\N{\reng}And no, we're not in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.53,0:37:05.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本该回到原来的时空\N{\reng}I was supposed to be back in the present,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.33,0:37:06.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我还在过去\N{\reng}but I'm still in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.41,0:37:08.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不应该有两个我\N{\reng}And there's not supposed to be two of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.08,0:37:10.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和我不该出现在同一个时空里\N{\reng}You and I are not supposed to be occupying the same reality at all,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.96,0:37:12.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更不该像这样互动\N{\reng}let alone interacting.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.17,0:37:14.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不敢相信我是个能够穿越时空的超级英雄\N{\reng}I just can't believe I'm a superhero who time travels--
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.04,0:37:17.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 你还什么都不是\N{\reng}No, no, no. You are not anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.92,0:37:18.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是好事\N{\reng}Which is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.80,0:37:20.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不会想当超级英雄的 太可怕了\N{\reng}You don't want to be a superhero. It's scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.68,0:37:24.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且跑起来时 牙缝里全是小虫子\N{\reng}And I get bug splatter in my teeth all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.55,0:37:25.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厉害\N{\reng}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.93,0:37:27.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再表演一遍\N{\reng}Hey, do the thing again.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.93,0:37:29.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 没时间了\N{\reng}No, we don't have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.35,0:37:32.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\reng}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.06,0:37:34.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你干吗 还想告状\N{\reng}What are you doing? You're gonna tattle now?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.44,0:37:36.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再来一遍\N{\reng}Do the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.32,0:37:37.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\reng}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.28,0:37:43.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爽\N{\reng}Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.16,0:37:43.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,满意了吗\N{\reng}Happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.03,0:37:45.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,满意了 再放回去\N{\reng}Now undo it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.93,0:38:04.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好疼\N{\reng}Ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.84,0:38:07.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里 你在楼上没事吧\N{\reng}Barry, are you okay up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.60,0:38:08.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们没事\N{\reng}We're fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.47,0:38:09.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\reng}I'm fine! Okay, Monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.73,0:38:13.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们有可以水下飞行的飞机了吗\N{\reng}So, do you have like a plane that goes underwater?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.69,0:38:16.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天上飞的船呢\N{\reng}Or like a boat that can fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.40,0:38:17.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你多大 40岁\N{\reng}How old are you, like 40?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.44,0:38:19.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 你话怎么这么多\N{\reng}Okay, you don't stop talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.65,0:38:20.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太不讨喜了\N{\reng}It's not charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.82,0:38:22.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既不中听 还让人心累\N{\reng}It's abrasive and exhausting.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.65,0:38:23.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\reng}And, oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.57,0:38:25.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才知道我原来这么讨人厌\N{\reng}I am starting to realize what people mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.57,0:38:26.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就当\N{\reng}Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.03,0:38:28.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮我个忙\N{\reng}do me a favor
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.16,0:38:31.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我保证 我们的见面不会破坏时空秩序\N{\reng}and promise me that meeting me isn't gonna screw up space-time.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.46,0:38:33.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好兄弟\N{\reng}Broski...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.46,0:38:35.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\reng}I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.54,0:38:36.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了 这下我麻烦大了\N{\reng}Shit, I'm in so much trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.04,0:38:38.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\reng}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.34,0:38:40.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么办\N{\reng}What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.42,0:38:42.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你下药\N{\reng}I could drug you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.97,0:38:44.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 迷晕你\N{\reng}Yeah, I could drug you,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.09,0:38:45.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等你再醒来的时候\N{\reng}and then you'd pass out, you'd wake up
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.72,0:38:46.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就会忘记这一切\N{\reng}and you'd forget that anything ever happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.05,0:38:48.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么做没毛病吧 因为我们是同一人\N{\reng}And it wouldn't be wrong, right? Because you're me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.86,0:38:50.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 我是说 不能这么做\N{\reng}No! I mean, we shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.95,0:38:51.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你不要\N{\reng}Please don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.07,0:38:52.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我下药\N{\reng}drug me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.81,0:38:53.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行\N{\reng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.18,0:38:54.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 因为我已经仔细想过了\N{\reng}No. Because here's the thing, and I thought about it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.94,0:38:56.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不想被下药\N{\reng}I don't want to be drugged.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.48,0:38:59.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们肯定还有别的办法\N{\reng}But I'm sure we can think of another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.65,0:39:01.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们打开脑洞 好好想想\N{\reng}Let's put on our Barry thinking caps
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.15,0:39:02.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定有别的办法\N{\reng}and think of a different solution
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.03,0:39:04.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能让我失忆\N{\reng}for memory loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.53,0:39:07.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有 我练过巴西战舞 已经绿带了\N{\reng}Also, I'm a green belt... in the capoeira,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.03,0:39:10.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还仔细研究过格斗摔跤\N{\reng}and I have extensively studied wrestler,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.20,0:39:12.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要真对我动手 肯定会吃大亏的\N{\reng}and I could just go frickin' lunatic on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.83,0:39:14.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,何况 我今晚还有约会\N{\reng}Besides, I have a date tonight...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.96,0:39:17.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那好\N{\reng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.79,0:39:21.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要多大力气才能把他打到失忆\N{\reng}How hard do you have to hit someone to make them forget stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.09,0:39:23.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打过去的自己 未来的我会受伤吗\N{\reng}If I hit you in the past, will it hurt me in the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.84,0:39:25.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 你今晚有约会\N{\reng}Wait. You say you have a date tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.93,0:39:27.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 你刚刚想干什么\N{\reng}Yeah. Wait, what were you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.43,0:39:28.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\reng}Uh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.43,0:39:29.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟谁约会\N{\reng}Who's your date with?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.43,0:39:32.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,经济学课同班的一个大美女\N{\reng}This super babe in my econ class.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.35,0:39:33.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾瑞斯韦斯特\N{\reng}Iris West?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.43,0:39:34.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老的天啊\N{\reng}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.68,0:39:35.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会娶她\N{\reng}Do we marry her?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.81,0:39:37.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你今晚要去和她约会\N{\reng}You're going on a date with her tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.44,0:39:39.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我回来让妈妈帮忙洗衣服\N{\reng}That's why I need Mom to do my laundry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.52,0:39:41.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连自己的衣服都不洗\N{\reng}You don't even do your own laundry?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.15,0:39:42.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\reng}Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.69,0:39:43.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\reng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.57,0:39:45.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真得走了\N{\reng}I'm actually gonna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.53,0:39:46.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你什么意思\N{\reng}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.40,0:39:48.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好过日子 做自己\N{\reng}Enjoy your life. Do you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.28,0:39:49.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么都别改变\N{\reng}Change literally nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.70,0:39:51.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走了 再也不见\N{\reng}Um, I'll see you again never.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.08,0:39:52.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可我还有几个问题\N{\reng}I have a few more questions, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.83,0:39:54.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还有很多事没弄清楚\N{\reng}We have so much to learn from each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.21,0:39:57.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的\N{\reng}Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.29,0:39:58.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要拍屁股走人\N{\reng}Well, you're leaving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.29,0:40:00.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雨把我的约会也毁了\N{\reng}And now the storm's gonna ruin my date.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.46,0:40:02.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是哪天\N{\reng}What day is it today?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.43,0:40:08.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,星期天吧\N{\reng}Sunday?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.68,0:40:09.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 日期\N{\reng}No, the date.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.68,0:40:13.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,9月29日\N{\reng}It's September 29th.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.10,0:40:15.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\reng}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.06,0:40:18.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这场暴风雨 就是这一天\N{\reng}This storm, this is the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.73,0:40:19.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪一天\N{\reng}What day?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.81,0:40:21.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我获得超能力的那天\N{\reng}The day I got my powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.27,0:40:23.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你获得超能力的这天\N{\reng}The day you get your powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.44,0:40:25.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超能力\N{\reng}Powers?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.32,0:40:26.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着\N{\reng}Listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.28,0:40:28.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能告诉你 我为什么回到过去\N{\reng}I can't tell you why I traveled back in time,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.15,0:40:30.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不能告诉你 我改变了什么\N{\reng}and I can't tell you what I changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.66,0:40:33.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之就是在我的时空里\N{\reng}But, essentially, in my version of reality,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.08,0:40:36.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我上大一时 在中心城的犯罪实验室实习\N{\reng}I ended up interning at the Central City Crime Lab in my freshman year,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.54,0:40:38.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是在那里发生的\N{\reng}and that's where it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.08,0:40:39.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将要发生\N{\reng}Well, happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.33,0:40:40.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就今晚 9月29日\N{\reng}Tonight, September 29,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.71,0:40:42.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那场意外给了我超能力\N{\reng}the accident that gives me my powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.67,0:40:44.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是你没在那儿\N{\reng}And if you're not there...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.21,0:40:46.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只剩半小时了\N{\reng}in 30 minutes...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.92,0:40:49.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就无法获得超能力\N{\reng}then you won't get the powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.47,0:40:52.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是说 我也有可能无法获取超能力\N{\reng}Which means I don't get the powers, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.30,0:40:55.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果这样的话 我从一开始就不可能\N{\reng}And then, that would mean that I lose my way
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.31,0:40:56.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,穿越时空 回到过去\N{\reng}of getting back in time in the first place,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.98,0:40:59.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之后会发生什么 我就真的不知道了\N{\reng}and then I literally have no idea what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.10,0:41:01.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超能力\N{\reng}Powers?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.28,0:41:06.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 那约会怎么办\N{\reng}Wait, but what about our date tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.82,0:41:09.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她可能是我们未来的妻子啊\N{\reng}She might be our future wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.82,0:41:12.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是你现在不跟我走的话\N{\reng}There might not be a future...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.57,0:41:14.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能就没有未来了\N{\reng}if you don't come with me...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.53,0:41:15.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就现在\N{\reng}right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.54,0:41:23.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有八分钟\N{\reng}Eight minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.92,0:41:25.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要怎么进去\N{\reng}How are we gonna to get inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.17,0:41:26.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要干吗\N{\reng}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.30,0:41:27.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能少说两句吗\N{\reng}Would you stop whining?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.42,0:41:29.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来的感觉会有点儿怪\N{\reng}This is gonna feel kinda weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.66,0:41:55.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这么穿过来了\N{\reng}We walk through the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.20,0:41:58.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 靠的是神速力共振\N{\reng}Yes, it's okay. It's called phasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.41,0:41:59.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\reng}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.42,0:42:03.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太过瘾了\N{\reng}I love phasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.92,0:42:10.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走 紧紧跟在我后面\N{\reng}Everybody moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.41,0:42:35.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\reng}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.95,0:42:36.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这儿\N{\reng}this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.91,0:42:38.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当时就坐在这里\N{\reng}This is where I was sitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.91,0:42:41.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 来 我先帮你放一边\N{\reng}And actually, let me take this for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.16,0:42:42.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢啦\N{\reng}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.21,0:42:45.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想想 当时 我打开的是那扇窗户\N{\reng}Okay, I had just opened those windows...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.54,0:42:48.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为的是给室内通通风\N{\reng}to clear out the fumes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.55,0:42:50.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快到时间了\N{\reng}Right around now.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.67,0:42:52.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当时 我坐在这把椅子上\N{\reng}And I was sitting in that chair,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.67,0:42:54.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就坐在这排架子前面\N{\reng}and I was right under this shelf of chemicals.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.59,0:42:56.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后 闪电就劈了进来\N{\reng}And that's when the lightning hits.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.43,0:42:57.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等\N{\reng}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.35,0:42:58.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会被闪电劈中\N{\reng}I get hit by lightning?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.72,0:42:59.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\reng}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.60,0:43:00.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不会被闪电劈中\N{\reng}You don't get hit by lightning.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.60,0:43:02.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 有一瞬间我还以为\N{\reng}Okay, 'cause for a second I thought you said...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.10,0:43:03.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闪电会劈中化学试剂\N{\reng}The lightning hits the chemicals...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.60,0:43:05.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后把它们溅到你身上\N{\reng}which then you get bathed in,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.19,0:43:06.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,导致你被电击\N{\reng}and that's what electrocutes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.31,0:43:08.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 我可不想被电死\N{\reng}Okay, but I don't want to be electrocuted, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.19,0:43:09.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐好别动\N{\reng}Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.07,0:43:10.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 该坐好的是你 - 我已经有超能力了\N{\reng}-No, you sit down. -I already have the powers!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.03,0:43:12.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已经有超能力了\N{\reng}You already have the powers!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.19,0:43:13.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊\N{\reng}Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.15,0:43:15.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不想被雷劈\N{\reng}I am not getting struck by lightning!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.32,0:43:56.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了\N{\reng}It worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.29,0:44:05.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好像掉了一颗牙\N{\reng}It looks like you lost a tooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.42,0:44:13.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有\N{\reng}No?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.30,0:44:14.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你掉的\N{\reng}You lost a tooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.35,0:44:28.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 我们撤\N{\reng}All right. We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.81,0:44:32.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出什么事了\N{\reng}What have we got?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.44,0:44:35.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无菌实验室的警报响了\N{\reng}The alarms in the sterile lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.28,0:44:36.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去检查一下\N{\reng}Go check it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.91,0:44:42.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去门口守着\N{\reng}Securing the entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.04,0:44:47.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得穿出去\N{\reng}We've gotta phase.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.41,0:44:48.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,共振 共振\N{\reng}Phase, phasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.67,0:45:35.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\reng}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.30,0:45:41.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我变慢了\N{\reng}I'm slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.18,0:45:52.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这儿怎么比我想象的整洁那么多\N{\reng}Why is your place so much nicer than I expected it to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.94,0:45:55.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喜欢吗 妈妈帮着收拾的\N{\reng}You like it? Mom had to help decorate.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.52,0:45:56.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是了解她的\N{\reng}You know Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.69,0:45:59.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 确实 她就这样\N{\reng}Right, yeah. Classic Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.40,0:46:00.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她就这样\N{\reng}Classic Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.54,0:46:08.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天可真刺激\N{\reng}What a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.70,0:46:10.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里 那场意外给了你超能力\N{\reng}Barry, the accident gave you powers,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.96,0:46:12.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也夺走了我的超能力\N{\reng}but took mine away.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.54,0:46:14.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我不知道该怎么回去了\N{\reng}So, I don't know how I get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.42,0:46:15.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果用不了神速力\N{\reng}Without access to the Speed Force,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.04,0:46:18.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都不知道该怎么离开这里\N{\reng}I don't know how I ever leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.67,0:46:20.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你明白我的意思吗\N{\reng}Do you understand what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.67,0:46:22.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可能被困住了\N{\reng}I might be stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.18,0:46:23.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\reng}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.34,0:46:26.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有超能力了\N{\reng}I have powers now?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.10,0:46:27.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 但是\N{\reng}Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.81,0:46:29.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你 不不不\N{\reng}you... No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.82,0:46:44.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这也太棒了\N{\reng}Holy speedballs.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.82,0:46:47.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 我知道你现在一定很激动\N{\reng}Okay, I know this is incredibly exciting,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.28,0:46:49.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我就是过来人 像飞毛腿冈萨雷斯一样\N{\reng}because I went through it. Speedy Gonzales!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.70,0:46:52.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 我自己也玩过很多次\N{\reng}Yes, I've done it many times myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.08,0:46:53.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你不能一上来就\N{\reng}You can't just start...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.92,0:46:55.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\reng}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.04,0:46:58.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歌词大意 我们年轻\N{\reng}? We are young,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.42,0:47:00.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,充满活力\N{\reng}we run green ?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.17,0:47:01.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保持牙齿\N{\reng}? Keep our teeth
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.71,0:47:03.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干净整齐\N{\reng}Nice and clean ?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.30,0:47:04.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,问亲访友\N{\reng}? See our friends
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.05,0:47:06.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出游观光\N{\reng}See the sights ?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.47,0:47:08.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉挺好的\N{\reng}? And feel all right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.85,0:47:11.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弄点小钱\N{\reng}? Got some cash
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.56,0:47:12.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,买辆小车\N{\reng}Bought some wheels ?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.06,0:47:14.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开车出门\N{\reng}? Took it out
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.81,0:47:16.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,穿越原野\N{\reng}'Cross the fields ?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.35,0:47:17.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,车子失控\N{\reng}? Lost control,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.02,0:47:19.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,撞到墙上\N{\reng}hit a wall ?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.52,0:47:21.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们挺好的\N{\reng}? But we're all right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.58,0:47:33.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\reng}Oh, my...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.28,0:48:10.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我马上走 我马上走\N{\reng}Okay, I'm leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.04,0:48:21.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,举起手来\N{\reng}Put your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.56,0:48:38.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你干什么了\N{\reng}What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.60,0:48:39.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没干什么\N{\reng}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.81,0:48:40.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\reng}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.78,0:48:47.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里\N{\reng}Barry...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.95,0:48:49.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚才没跟你说衣服的事\N{\reng}I could've told you about the clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.45,0:48:50.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩擦生热\N{\reng}It's friction.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.41,0:48:52.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跑得太快 普通衣服是会烧坏的\N{\reng}You run too fast, and regular fabrics are gonna burn up.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.78,0:48:54.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同理 不能在超光速状态下\N{\reng}It's the same reason why you can't
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.29,0:48:55.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把人移得太远\N{\reng}move people very far at hyperspeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.83,0:48:57.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西兰花好像坏了\N{\reng}That broccoli looks rotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.54,0:48:58.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好 有些东西是可以在超光速下移动的\N{\reng}Look, some things you can move.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.04,0:49:01.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如 你可以移动\N{\reng}Like, you can move,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.33,0:49:02.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,微波炉\N{\reng}for instance, a microwave.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.04,0:49:05.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有些就绝对不能移动 比如\N{\reng}But you can't move something like, say...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.42,0:49:06.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小宝宝\N{\reng}a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.30,0:49:08.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里 我好像从来没吃过这么好的东西\N{\reng}Barry, it's like I've never eaten anything before.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.59,0:49:11.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,味道特别 特别鲜活\N{\reng}Everything has this vivid flavor. Try a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.34,0:49:13.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尝一口 就一小口\N{\reng}Just take a little bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.43,0:49:15.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是很难吃\N{\reng}That's bad, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.35,0:49:16.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然很不好吃\N{\reng}Yeah, this is not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.35,0:49:17.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 我逗你的\N{\reng}No, I was kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.35,0:49:19.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好厉害 我们都好厉害\N{\reng}I'm amazing. We're amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.48,0:49:21.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好饿\N{\reng}I'm so hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.31,0:49:23.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\reng}Hey, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.65,0:49:24.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想试试那个共振\N{\reng}I wanna try that phasing thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.90,0:49:25.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是怎么个振法\N{\reng}How do I do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.03,0:49:28.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先等等 没到时候呢 好吗\N{\reng}You don't. Not yet. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.53,0:49:29.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,共振非常复杂\N{\reng}It's very complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.78,0:49:30.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要练很长时间\N{\reng}Takes a long time
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.66,0:49:32.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才能在身体整个加速的同时\N{\reng}to train your body to be able to speed up
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.28,0:49:34.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让身上分子的振动速度放慢\N{\reng}whilst your molecules slow down enough to pass through
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.08,0:49:36.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,穿过固体的分子结构\N{\reng}the molecular structure of solid objects...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.79,0:49:41.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快给我滚出去\N{\reng}Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.67,0:49:49.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得先学会让我把话说完\N{\reng}You've gotta start letting me finish my sentences.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.30,0:49:54.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是一直这样又困 又饿\N{\reng}Are we always this sleepy? And hungry
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.18,0:49:55.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没衣服穿吗\N{\reng}and naked?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.97,0:49:57.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前两条 是的\N{\reng}Well, the first two, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.18,0:49:59.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第三条 不是 我已经有办法了\N{\reng}The third one, no. I've figured that part out.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.98,0:50:02.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实话告诉你 如果教你这些\N{\reng}And honestly, if we're gonna do this
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.44,0:50:03.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有很多东西得跟你解释\N{\reng}there's a lot I'm gonna have to explain to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.81,0:50:06.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得从这里开始讲比较好 就是\N{\reng}So, a good place to start, I guess, is that,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.07,0:50:08.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 最初的战服\N{\reng}yeah, the original suit
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.94,0:50:11.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是用一种复合材料制成\N{\reng}- was actually made out of this polysynth...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.07,0:50:13.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者 那就\N{\reng}Or we'll
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.32,0:50:14.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天再继续说吧\N{\reng}pick this up tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.03,0:50:16.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说 战服在戒指里\N{\reng}So, the suit is inside the ring?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.95,0:50:17.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\reng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.91,0:50:19.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的\N{\reng}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.29,0:50:21.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个是送我了吗\N{\reng}And I can have this?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.21,0:50:22.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不是送你\N{\reng}No, you can't have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.79,0:50:23.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是借给你\N{\reng}You can borrow it
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.71,0:50:24.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,免得你让自己的超能力害死\N{\reng}so you don't kill yourself using your powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.84,0:50:27.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你按下这个按钮以后\N{\reng}You're gonna push this button
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.92,0:50:29.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蚕丝分子会展开\N{\reng}and the silk molecules are gonna uncoil,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.21,0:50:30.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吸收大气中的气体\N{\reng}absorbing atmospheric gases
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.47,0:50:32.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把战服完全撑开\N{\reng}and expanding the suit to full size.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.09,0:50:33.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好了吗\N{\reng}Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.40,0:50:53.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它出来的时候可真小啊\N{\reng}It was so tiny...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.07,0:50:55.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该在它落地前就穿好它\N{\reng}You're supposed to put it on before it hits the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.20,0:50:58.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要 在你面前穿吗\N{\reng}What, like change... right here in front of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.28,0:51:00.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这附近根本就没有别人 巴里\N{\reng}There's no one even here anyway, Barry.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.29,0:51:01.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点儿\N{\reng}Come on--
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.79,0:51:02.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\reng}Whoo, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.79,0:51:03.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好紧\N{\reng}Tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.79,0:51:05.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有点疼\N{\reng}It hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.17,0:51:07.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道是哪儿疼吗\N{\reng}You know where it hurts?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.29,0:51:08.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里疼\N{\reng}In my dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.17,0:51:10.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 我懂 我懂\N{\reng}Okay. I know, I know,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.21,0:51:11.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我不想知道\N{\reng}but I don't need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.67,0:51:13.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 我能继续了吗\N{\reng}Sorry, can we move on?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.93,0:51:14.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是这么想的\N{\reng}Here's what I'm thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.55,0:51:17.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要我能教会你像我那样移动\N{\reng}If I can train you to move like I do,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.43,0:51:18.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就能重建时空之碗\N{\reng}then we can re-create the Chronobowl.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.93,0:51:19.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时空之碗\N{\reng}Chronobowl?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.81,0:51:20.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用神速力\N{\reng}In the Speed Force.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.81,0:51:21.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神速力\N{\reng}Speed Force?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.06,0:51:23.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样 也许我就能找出办法 回到未来\N{\reng}And then maybe we can find some way to get me back to the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.06,0:51:25.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《回到未来》\N{\reng}Back to the Future.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.19,0:51:27.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好看 艾瑞克斯托罗兹\N{\reng}Yes! Eric Stoltz
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.81,0:51:30.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在里面演得特别好\N{\reng}is chur boy in that movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.19,0:51:32.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他把角色完全演活了\N{\reng}What an embodied performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.53,0:51:33.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是迈克尔J福克斯吧\N{\reng}You mean Michael J. Fox?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.20,0:51:35.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《回到未来》吗\N{\reng}Back to the Future?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.28,0:51:37.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对 就是电影《回到未来》 - 天啊\N{\reng}- Yeah, in the movie Back to the Future? - -Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.54,0:51:43.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事 - 不知道\N{\reng}-What's going on? -I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.42,0:51:51.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得先把战服脱了\N{\reng}You need to take the suit off now.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.05,0:51:53.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢天谢地\N{\reng}Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.18,0:51:58.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目击者表示\N{\reng}...reported seeing a mysterious object
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.97,0:52:01.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,澳大利亚海岸上空悬停着一枚神秘物体\N{\reng}hovering above the Australian seaboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.43,0:52:05.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 以下是本台取得的录像片段 - 佐德\N{\reng}-We've obtained footage from the sighting and as you can see, the object... -Zod.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.94,0:52:07.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,“糟的”\N{\reng}"Zod"?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.48,0:52:10.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么“糟的”\N{\reng}What's a zod?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.07,0:52:13.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美国政府官员称\N{\reng}According to US government officials,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.28,0:52:15.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,基于卫星数据显示\N{\reng}satellite data
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.15,0:52:16.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是一艘宇宙飞船\N{\reng}has confirmed the presence of a spacecraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.95,0:52:17.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会跟进\N{\reng}We'll be sure--
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.04,0:52:24.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们可以叫我佐德将军\N{\reng}My name is General Zod.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.71,0:52:28.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的星球离地球非常遥远\N{\reng}I come from a world far from yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.17,0:52:31.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们的星球长久以来\N{\reng}For some time, your world
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.67,0:52:34.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 庇护了我们的一位公民 - 糟了\N{\reng}-has sheltered one of my citizens. -No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.55,0:52:36.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这不可能 - 我要求你们立刻…\N{\reng}-This can't be happening. -I request that you return this individual...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.09,0:52:39.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把这个人送回来交给我看管 偏偏在这个时候\N{\reng}- Not now. - ...to my custody.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.80,0:52:41.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出什么事了\N{\reng}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.56,0:52:44.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐德在找超人\N{\reng}Zod's looking for Superman.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.23,0:52:46.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么超人\N{\reng}What's a superman?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.48,0:52:50.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超人是生活在地球上的外星人\N{\reng}Superman is an alien who lives on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.56,0:52:52.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜他还在隐藏身份\N{\reng}I'm assuming still incognito.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.90,0:52:54.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 他是外星人\N{\reng}But, yeah, he's an alien,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.40,0:52:56.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常非常厉害\N{\reng}and he's very powerful,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.15,0:52:57.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人也特别好\N{\reng}and he's just the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.78,0:53:00.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐德和超人来自同一个星球\N{\reng}And then Zod is an alien from the same planet,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.03,0:53:02.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他也很厉害\N{\reng}also very powerful,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.28,0:53:03.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他是个大坏蛋\N{\reng}but he's just the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.95,0:53:06.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而当时 佐德就是来找克拉克的\N{\reng}And Zod came here to find Clark.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.91,0:53:07.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 克拉克又是谁\N{\reng}Wait, who's Clark?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.91,0:53:09.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克拉克就是超人\N{\reng}Clark is Superman.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.08,0:53:10.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\reng}Oh. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.04,0:53:12.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后 佐德\N{\reng}But then Zod
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.34,0:53:15.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还想用他的创世引擎彻底改造地球的生态\N{\reng}also tried to terraform the planet with this World Engine thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.42,0:53:17.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后超人阻止了他 可是在那之前\N{\reng}and Superman stopped him eventually,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.92,0:53:19.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐德已经杀死了好多好多人\N{\reng}but not before Zod killed thousands of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.97,0:53:20.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 在那个时候\N{\reng}-Yeesh. -And at the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.05,0:53:23.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我什么都做不了 我\N{\reng}there was nothing I could do, I've...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.23,0:53:28.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等\N{\reng}Wait, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.60,0:53:30.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你 你当时在场\N{\reng}You were there?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.56,0:53:33.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 当时我刚刚获得超能力\N{\reng}Yeah, I had just gotten my powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.53,0:53:38.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还在对战服做最后的修改\N{\reng}And I was still putting some finishing touches on my suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.57,0:53:44.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐德的创世引擎\N{\reng}This thing, Zod's World Engine,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.41,0:53:46.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当时已经开始摧毁大都会了\N{\reng}it started destroying Metropolis,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.16,0:53:48.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我就赶了过去\N{\reng}so I just went there
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.41,0:53:49.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要救人\N{\reng}and I started trying to save people.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.92,0:53:51.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\reng}Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.29,0:53:55.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听话 快跑啊\N{\reng}Listen to me! Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.84,0:53:57.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快跑啊\N{\reng}Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.30,0:54:04.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个孩子\N{\reng}There was this kid, and I...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.43,0:54:06.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我救了他 可\N{\reng}I got him, but then...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.10,0:54:08.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没法再救他爸爸\N{\reng}I couldn't get his dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.73,0:54:12.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\reng}Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.83,0:54:31.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当年 我只有能力救那个孩子\N{\reng}It was all I could do, save that one kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.29,0:54:35.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有超人能够阻止佐德\N{\reng}Only Superman could stop Zod.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.05,0:54:38.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可他也没来得及救那些人\N{\reng}But not in time to save those people.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.17,0:54:40.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在 同样的事情又要重演了\N{\reng}And now it's about to happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.17,0:54:42.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过\N{\reng}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.80,0:54:44.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我能集结整个正义联盟\N{\reng}if I can find the entire Justice League,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.80,0:54:46.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是超人和其他的英雄\N{\reng}Superman and the rest of the band...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.18,0:54:48.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\reng}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.56,0:54:51.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许我就能阻止这些事情的发生\N{\reng}...then maybe I can prevent the whole thing from ever even happening at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.19,0:54:57.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把你的电脑给我\N{\reng}Um, give me your laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.07,0:54:58.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\reng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.15,0:54:59.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么味道\N{\reng}What is that smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.15,0:55:01.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有味道的东西多了\N{\reng}Could be anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.82,0:55:02.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的\N{\reng}Honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.16,0:55:05.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是谁\N{\reng}Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.82,0:55:06.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是加里\N{\reng}That's Gary.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.78,0:55:08.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是他身上的味道\N{\reng}That's the smell. It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.16,0:55:09.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事 他这人就是很随意\N{\reng}Don't worry. He's breezy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.54,0:55:12.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定能查到的\N{\reng}We can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.58,0:55:13.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看\N{\reng}Uh, let's see,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.46,0:55:15.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,维克多斯通 哥谭城市大学\N{\reng}Victor Stone, Gotham City University.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.84,0:55:20.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这位是我室友 帕蒂\N{\reng}Oh, this is my roommate, Patty.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.67,0:55:22.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帕蒂 是你室友\N{\reng}Patty... is your roommate?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.05,0:55:24.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是她男朋友阿尔伯特\N{\reng}And that's her boyfriend, Albert.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.30,0:55:26.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好啊\N{\reng}What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.80,0:55:28.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好\N{\reng}Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.43,0:55:31.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\reng}Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.31,0:55:32.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个 各位\N{\reng}And, uh, guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.98,0:55:34.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这位是我表哥\N{\reng}This is my cousin.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.44,0:55:36.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里\N{\reng}Barry.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.53,0:55:43.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我饿死了\N{\reng}I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.03,0:55:48.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\reng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.32,0:55:50.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,维克多斯通 哥谭城市大学\N{\reng}Victor Stone, Gotham City University.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.20,0:55:51.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 就是他\N{\reng}Yes. Here he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.99,0:55:54.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,骑士队明星四分卫 维克多斯通将迎来创纪录之年\N{\reng}Victor Stone, star quarterback for the Knight...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.29,0:55:55.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死 好吧\N{\reng}Shit, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.42,0:55:56.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还没有变成钢骨\N{\reng}He's not Cyborg yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.04,0:55:58.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神奇女侠\N{\reng}Wonder Woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.34,0:56:00.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神奇女侠\N{\reng}Wonder Woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.92,0:56:02.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拉斯维加斯常驻表演\N{\reng}Las Vegas residency.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.17,0:56:05.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔术 杂耍和斑马秀\N{\reng}Illusions, juggling, and zebras.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.93,0:56:08.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不对 这不是戴安娜\N{\reng}No. That is not Diana.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.18,0:56:08.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海王\N{\reng}Aquaman.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.05,0:56:10.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海王 这是一种\N{\reng}Aquaman? Is that like
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.06,0:56:11.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超级人鱼吗\N{\reng}a super mermaid?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.93,0:56:14.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,错 阿尔伯特 不是超级人鱼\N{\reng}No, Albert, he's not a super mermaid.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.43,0:56:15.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\reng}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.31,0:56:16.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是亚特兰蒂斯人和人类生的混血儿\N{\reng}He's half Atlantean, half human
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.06,0:56:18.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,力量超凡\N{\reng}with superhuman strength
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.23,0:56:20.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能用意念控制海洋生物\N{\reng}who can control marine life with his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.27,0:56:21.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不就是超级人鱼\N{\reng}So, like a super mermaid?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.32,0:56:22.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,错 阿尔伯特\N{\reng}No, Albert!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.15,0:56:24.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说的就是这个意思\N{\reng}That is what you described.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.53,0:56:26.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来搜一下亚瑟库瑞\N{\reng}We'll just try Arthur Curry...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.53,0:56:27.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,缅因的\N{\reng}Maine...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.91,0:56:31.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,灯塔\N{\reng}lighthouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.41,0:56:32.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了\N{\reng}Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.29,0:56:34.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托马斯库瑞 这是他爸爸\N{\reng}Thomas Curry. That's his dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.20,0:56:35.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电话给我\N{\reng}Uh, phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.08,0:56:37.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好\N{\reng}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.96,0:56:39.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您好 是托马斯库瑞吗\N{\reng}Hello, Thomas Curry?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.33,0:56:40.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是\N{\reng}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.21,0:56:43.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能找下亚瑟吗 亚瑟在家吗\N{\reng}Could I speak to Arthur? Is Arthur around?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.21,0:56:44.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想找我家的狗\N{\reng}You wanna speak to my dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.71,0:56:45.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\reng}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.67,0:56:46.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\reng}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.18,0:56:48.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\reng}Um, sorry. Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.18,0:56:49.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您是托马斯库瑞吗\N{\reng}Is this Thomas Curry?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.34,0:56:50.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\reng}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.47,0:56:52.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您在灯塔工作\N{\reng}And you work at a lighthouse?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.43,0:56:53.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\reng}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.31,0:56:54.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 您爱人是\N{\reng}Okay, and your wife
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.47,0:56:55.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚特兰蒂斯女王吗\N{\reng}is the queen of Atlantis?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.44,0:57:00.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是\N{\reng}Uh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.98,0:57:02.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 或者说 她是不是一位\N{\reng}Uh, right, but maybe, maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.77,0:57:04.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像鱼一样的女士\N{\reng}um, a fishlike woman
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.78,0:57:06.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一天搁浅在了岸边\N{\reng}washed into your life
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.65,0:57:08.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进入了你的生活呢\N{\reng}at some point or another?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.32,0:57:09.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可真幽默 混球\N{\reng}Very funny, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.28,0:57:13.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚瑟库瑞根本没出生\N{\reng}Arthur Curry was never born.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.08,0:57:14.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\reng}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.95,0:57:16.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简直是一场灾难 我\N{\reng}This is a disaster. I-I-
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.58,0:57:17.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彻底扰乱了历史\N{\reng}I completely destroyed history.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.91,0:57:18.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像艾瑞克斯托罗兹\N{\reng}Like Eric Stoltz.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.04,0:57:20.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说 你怎么老提这个人的名字\N{\reng}Okay, why do you keep saying, "Eric Stoltz"?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.92,0:57:22.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他演了马蒂麦克弗莱\N{\reng}Eric Stoltz is Marty McFly.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.34,0:57:23.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\reng}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.21,0:57:24.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时间旅行\N{\reng}Time travel?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.96,0:57:26.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们在聊《回到未来》\N{\reng}We talking "BTTF"?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.17,0:57:27.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 这人到底是谁\N{\reng}Come on, who is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.22,0:57:29.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 我知道\N{\reng}Okay, yeah, no, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.09,0:57:30.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把《回到未来》全看了\N{\reng}I've seen all of them
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.80,0:57:33.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马蒂麦克弗莱不是艾瑞克斯托罗兹演的\N{\reng}and Eric Stoltz is not Marty McFly.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.30,0:57:34.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\reng}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.31,0:57:38.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那这个麦克“股”莱怎么解释\N{\reng}Then explain Marty McThigh here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.23,0:57:39.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没法跟你解释 加里\N{\reng}I can't explain that to you, Gary.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.56,0:57:40.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那儿可不是“股”\N{\reng}That's not your thigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.44,0:57:43.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,演员也纹错了 还上下颠倒了\N{\reng}It's the wrong actor, and it's upside down.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.02,0:57:46.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\reng}Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.15,0:57:50.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可重点在于\N{\reng}The point is that
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.57,0:57:52.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在《回到未来》里\N{\reng}in Back to the Future
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.20,0:57:54.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都知道 演这个角色的人\N{\reng}Marty McFly is very famously played
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.28,0:57:55.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是迈克尔J福克斯\N{\reng}by Michael J. Fox.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.79,0:57:56.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,演《浑身是劲》的那个\N{\reng}The guy from Footloose?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.79,0:57:58.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,错 那是凯文培根\N{\reng}No, that's Kevin Bacon!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.33,0:57:59.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,培根\N{\reng}Bacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.21,0:58:00.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,培根演了独行侠\N{\reng}Kevin Bacon's Maverick
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.16,0:58:02.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打排球 秀肌肉 开飞机的那个\N{\reng}with the volleyball, the gay guys, and the planes?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.08,0:58:02.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《壮志凌云》\N{\reng}Top Gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.96,0:58:04.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,“熊熊的烈火” 《壮志凌云》\N{\reng}? Great balls of fire! ? Top Gun, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.67,0:58:05.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完了 完了 对吧\N{\reng}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.46,0:58:08.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把整个宇宙都给搅乱了\N{\reng}I completely broke the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.59,0:58:12.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯托罗兹演了麦克弗莱\N{\reng}Marty McFly is Eric Stoltz.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.59,0:58:13.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了\N{\reng}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.47,0:58:14.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\reng}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.85,0:58:16.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我制造了一个没有超人类的世界\N{\reng}I created a world with no metahumans.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.31,0:58:20.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这下没人帮我们抵挡佐德了\N{\reng}And now there's no one to defend us from Zod.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.18,0:58:21.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿尔伯特\N{\reng}Albert!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.85,0:58:23.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里没有钢骨\N{\reng}There's no Cyborg.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.73,0:58:27.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也没有海王 没有神奇女侠\N{\reng}There's no Aquaman. There's no Wonder Woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.19,0:58:28.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有超人\N{\reng}There's no Superman.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.57,0:58:29.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有蝙蝠侠\N{\reng}There's no Batman.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.78,0:58:30.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是蝙蝠侠\N{\reng}I'm Batman.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.16,0:58:35.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你 你刚才说什么来着\N{\reng}What, you... What did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.03,0:58:37.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是蝙蝠侠\N{\reng}I'm Batman.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.33,0:58:41.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这儿有蝙蝠侠\N{\reng}Batman exists?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.29,0:58:42.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\reng}Hundo p.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.17,0:58:44.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 兄弟 没人知道他的真实身份\N{\reng}Yeah, dude. Nobody knows who he really is,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.46,0:58:45.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 是有这么个人\N{\reng}but he exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.96,0:58:46.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\reng}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.34,0:58:48.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 我们\N{\reng}Well, uh, we...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.92,0:58:50.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和巴里表弟\N{\reng}my cousin Barry and I,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.84,0:58:53.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去另一位表哥家吃饭了\N{\reng}have to go to that cousin's dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.34,0:58:54.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在就得走\N{\reng}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.18,0:58:58.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过还是很高兴认识大家\N{\reng}But it was a pleasure to meet you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.93,0:58:59.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见 加里\N{\reng}And Gary. Barry.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.81,0:59:00.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见 巴里\N{\reng}Gary. Barry.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.98,0:59:01.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见 巴里\N{\reng}-Barry. -Gary.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.85,0:59:02.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见 加里\N{\reng}Gary. Barry.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.81,0:59:03.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里\N{\reng}Barry!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.71,0:59:26.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是在逗我吧 这是什么鬼地方\N{\reng}What, are you frickin' kidding me with this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.96,0:59:31.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是哪儿 地狱吗\N{\reng}What is this, hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.85,0:59:41.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,门没关\N{\reng}It's open.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.78,0:59:53.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快看 这些东西好酷\N{\reng}Look at all this cool shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.90,0:59:57.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行了 巴里 不要碰这里的东西\N{\reng}Okay, Barry, don't touch anything in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.04,1:00:03.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\reng}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.66,1:00:05.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布鲁斯\N{\reng}Bruce?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.17,1:00:08.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布鲁斯 你在吗\N{\reng}Bruce, are you there?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.34,1:00:11.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好家伙\N{\reng}Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.72,1:00:16.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都不知道你会画画\N{\reng}Hey, I didn't know you painted.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.18,1:00:18.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,画得挺好\N{\reng}They're good.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.05,1:00:21.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布鲁斯·韦恩\N{\reng}Bruce Wayne?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.65,1:00:35.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布鲁斯\N{\reng}Bruce?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.41,1:00:46.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看这里\N{\reng}Hey, check this out.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.66,1:00:48.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些铃铛连着这里的各个房间\N{\reng}There's, like, bells connected to every room in this house.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.92,1:00:50.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没准我们摇摇铃\N{\reng}Hey, maybe we can find this Bruce guy...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.21,1:00:52.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就能找到这位布鲁斯 你说呢\N{\reng}if we just ring all these bells, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.30,1:00:54.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不知道仆人铃怎么用吗\N{\reng}You don't understand how servant bells work?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.46,1:00:57.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是其他房间里的人摇铃召唤这里的人\N{\reng}You ring them from all the other places.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.18,1:00:57.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\reng}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.05,1:01:00.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们这边没有《唐顿庄园》吗\N{\reng}You don't have, like, Downton Abbey in your universe?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.30,1:01:01.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,“糖炖庄园”\N{\reng}Downtown Abbey's?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.80,1:01:03.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说那个连锁家常菜馆啊\N{\reng}The chain of, like, family-style restaurants?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.97,1:01:06.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是个价位低一些的香蕉蜂\N{\reng}They're like, it's like cheaper Bananabee's.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.85,1:01:08.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道我现在特想吃什么吗\N{\reng}Oh, you know what I'd really go for right now?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.98,1:01:11.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糖炖家的焦香西葫芦块\N{\reng}Abbey's sizzlin' zucchini squares.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.32,1:01:18.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行吧\N{\reng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.68,1:01:41.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有完没完\N{\reng}You know what, man?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.97,1:01:43.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是受够你了\N{\reng}I've had it with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.05,1:02:20.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是什么人\N{\reng}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.68,1:02:22.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是这儿的主人\N{\reng}I'm the guy who lives here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.30,1:02:25.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在找布鲁斯·韦恩\N{\reng}We're looking for Bruce Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.56,1:02:29.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们饿吗\N{\reng}You hungry?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.81,1:02:30.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐德将军播报后\N{\reng}...following the broadcast earlier from General Zod.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.23,1:02:33.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们寻找的目标依然没有音讯\N{\reng}The individual they're searching for is still at large.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.06,1:02:35.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以说\N{\reng}So...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.65,1:02:41.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和他是同一个人\N{\reng}...you're the same person as him...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.45,1:02:42.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你来自另一条时间线\N{\reng}but from an alternate timeline.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.95,1:02:43.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\reng}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.41,1:02:45.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在你那边\N{\reng}In which...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.04,1:02:48.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是好朋友\N{\reng}you and I are friends?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.45,1:02:49.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 你可能\N{\reng}Yeah, you're like
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.70,1:02:50.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我最好的朋友\N{\reng}probably my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.16,1:02:52.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\reng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.08,1:02:54.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你有点 你\N{\reng}Well, but you're a bit... you're, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.29,1:02:56.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的岁数有些 变化\N{\reng}chronologically different.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.79,1:02:57.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老了\N{\reng}Older.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.67,1:02:59.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这也正是我弄不明白的地方\N{\reng}That's what I can't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.30,1:03:03.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回到了过去 从这里回到这里\N{\reng}I traveled back in time from here to here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.34,1:03:05.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果不知道为什么 我回到了\N{\reng}Yet somehow, everything's all changed
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.18,1:03:07.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里\N{\reng}back here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.31,1:03:08.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者是你出生的时候\N{\reng}Or like when you were born, so...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.81,1:03:12.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时间不是线性的 对吧\N{\reng}Well... time isn't linear. Right?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.19,1:03:14.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\reng}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.15,1:03:18.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可能\N{\reng}At some point
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.19,1:03:21.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在电影里看到过这样的内容\N{\reng}you probably saw a movie that told you
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.82,1:03:23.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你回到过去 改变了历史\N{\reng}that if you went back and changed the past,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.91,1:03:27.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就会创造出一条时间线分支 对不对\N{\reng}you'd create a kind of a branched timeline, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.33,1:03:28.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看\N{\reng}Like, look.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.79,1:03:33.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新的当下\N{\reng}New present
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.79,1:03:35.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新的未来\N{\reng}and new future.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.46,1:03:36.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\reng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.33,1:03:37.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时间不是这么运转的\N{\reng}Well, time doesn't work like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.34,1:03:39.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是这个原理\N{\reng}That's not how time works.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.67,1:03:42.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你穿越回去 改变历史 就会创造出\N{\reng}When you go back and change the past
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.42,1:03:43.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个支点\N{\reng}you create a fulcrum.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.80,1:03:46.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你来到了一根新的意面上\N{\reng}You put yourself on a whole nother strand of spaghetti.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.97,1:03:48.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新的未来\N{\reng}New future.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.31,1:03:50.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新的过去\N{\reng}New past.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.93,1:03:53.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是逆因果\N{\reng}It's retrocausal.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.43,1:03:54.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以有两种走向\N{\reng}It goes both ways.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.85,1:03:56.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实际上 是有很多种走向\N{\reng}Actually, it goes many ways.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.06,1:03:58.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下次再说吧\N{\reng}Maybe some other time.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.02,1:04:01.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 但是在本体论悖论模型里 并没有\N{\reng}Okay, but in an ontological paradox model, there's not...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.69,1:04:04.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这样做 不但改变了未来\N{\reng}What you did was you changed the future
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.53,1:04:06.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也改变了过去\N{\reng}and you changed the past.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.53,1:04:10.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,倘若有人真的蠢到了家\N{\reng}If a person is stupid enough
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.79,1:04:12.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扰乱了时间秩序\N{\reng}to mess with time...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.29,1:04:13.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后就会导致\N{\reng}what you eventually end up with
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.04,1:04:15.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样的结果\N{\reng}is this.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.79,1:04:17.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多重宇宙\N{\reng}The multiverse.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.59,1:04:21.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有些时间线近乎平行\N{\reng}Some strands run almost parallel.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.92,1:04:24.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们之间难免会有交汇点\N{\reng}There will be inevitable intersections,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.55,1:04:26.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他时间线就会\N{\reng}and others that are just...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.47,1:04:28.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发散得很厉害\N{\reng}wildly divergent.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.80,1:04:29.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之就是\N{\reng}What it is...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.97,1:04:32.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一团糟\N{\reng}is a hot mess.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.68,1:04:34.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像掷骰子\N{\reng}It's a crapshoot.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.31,1:04:36.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全没有规律可言\N{\reng}It's all just a crapshoot.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.81,1:04:37.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那干酪又代表什么\N{\reng}What does the parmesan mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.94,1:04:39.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他打完比方了 就是弄点装饰\N{\reng}The metaphor's over. It's just a garnish.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.94,1:04:40.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就这么说吧\N{\reng}And I'll tell ya something.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.15,1:04:45.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有那种特别特别蠢的人\N{\reng}A person would have to be an idiot
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.65,1:04:46.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才会扰乱\N{\reng}to play craps
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.32,1:04:48.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时空连续统\N{\reng}with the space-time continuum.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.66,1:04:50.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 蠢\N{\reng}Yeah, an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.54,1:04:53.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给\N{\reng}Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.04,1:04:59.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你吃饭怎么会闹出这么大的动静\N{\reng}Are you joking with the chewing noises right now?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.04,1:05:01.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以说\N{\reng}So, uh,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.54,1:05:02.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是因为你\N{\reng}you're the reason
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.30,1:05:05.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个叫佐德的家伙\N{\reng}this Zod character
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.17,1:05:06.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才要毁灭地球\N{\reng}is about to destroy the Earth?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.05,1:05:08.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有可能\N{\reng}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.18,1:05:10.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有个叫超人的家伙\N{\reng}There's a guy called Superman
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.30,1:05:11.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以阻止佐德\N{\reng}who can stop Zod?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.43,1:05:12.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 对\N{\reng}Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.31,1:05:13.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还会飞\N{\reng}And flies?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.68,1:05:15.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还长着镭射眼\N{\reng}Shoots lasers out of his eyes?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.35,1:05:16.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 他会飞\N{\reng}Yes, he flies,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.31,1:05:17.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还长着镭射眼 没错\N{\reng}and he shoots lasers out of his eyes. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.81,1:05:19.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人觉得超人这名号\N{\reng}No one said "Superman"...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.69,1:05:22.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有点太刻意了吗\N{\reng}that might be a little on the nose?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.15,1:05:24.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你还管自己叫蝙蝠侠呢\N{\reng}You call yourself Batman.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.65,1:05:26.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 我又没管自己叫\N{\reng}Yeah. I don't call myself
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.19,1:05:27.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超级蝙蝠侠\N{\reng}Super Batman.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.16,1:05:30.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 他是蝙蝠侠吗\N{\reng}Wait, he's Batman?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.70,1:05:33.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然我们干吗到这里来\N{\reng}What did you think we were doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.41,1:05:35.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还以为是来表哥家里吃饭呢\N{\reng}I thought this was the cousin's dinner.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.91,1:05:38.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他 布鲁斯·韦恩是蝙蝠侠\N{\reng}He's... Bruce Wayne is Batman?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.16,1:05:40.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在也不完全是\N{\reng}Not really. Not so much anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.79,1:05:41.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道吗\N{\reng}You know...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.21,1:05:43.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人们不需要我了\N{\reng}they don't really need me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.34,1:05:46.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时过境迁\N{\reng}Things have changed.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.55,1:05:49.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥谭现在是全球最安全的城市之一\N{\reng}Gotham's now one of the safest cities in the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.18,1:05:51.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可我需要你\N{\reng}Well, I... I need you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.22,1:05:52.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们需要你\N{\reng}We need you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.18,1:05:53.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我那边\N{\reng}In my timeline,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.22,1:05:55.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蝙蝠侠是我们的军师和领袖\N{\reng}Batman's our strategist, our leader.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.47,1:05:56.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个世界需要超人\N{\reng}The world needs Superman.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.06,1:05:58.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你是最好的侦探\N{\reng}You're the best detective in the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.18,1:06:00.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许只有你才能帮我们找到他\N{\reng}You're probably the only person who can help me find him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.48,1:06:01.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 你愿意帮我们吗\N{\reng}So, will you help us?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.23,1:06:04.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愿意\N{\reng}Pass.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.28,1:06:11.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把盐递过去吗\N{\reng}Like pass the salt?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.78,1:06:12.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布鲁斯\N{\reng}Bruce?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.91,1:06:16.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然他不想帮忙\N{\reng}He doesn't want to help us...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.91,1:06:18.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就用他的蝙蝠设备自己查\N{\reng}we're gonna use his bat shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.54,1:06:19.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蝙蝠设备\N{\reng}Bat shit?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.04,1:06:22.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 蝙蝠侠的各种高级设备\N{\reng}Yeah, his bat stuff, his bat things.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.04,1:06:24.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你先站上去\N{\reng}Stand on that thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.30,1:06:29.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 记得你共振穿地板那次吗\N{\reng}Okay, remember when you phased through the floor?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.34,1:06:30.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得\N{\reng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.43,1:06:32.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 现在你得再来一次\N{\reng}So, I need you to do that again.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.69,1:06:41.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么地方\N{\reng}What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.96,1:07:51.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\reng}Dude!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.80,1:07:55.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个地方真是爆炫\N{\reng}This place straight beeves!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.47,1:07:56.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爆炫\N{\reng}"Beeves"?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.81,1:08:08.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里\N{\reng}Barry!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.52,1:08:11.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我差点摔死在\N{\reng}I almost died
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.28,1:08:12.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万丈深渊里\N{\reng}in an abyss!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.32,1:08:14.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美国有12805个叫克拉克肯特的人\N{\reng}12,805 Clark Kents in the US.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.91,1:08:17.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这难道是我想的那样东西吗\N{\reng}Is this what I think it is?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.58,1:08:29.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\reng}Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.46,1:08:30.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我小的时候\N{\reng}I used to see
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.79,1:08:32.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在电视新闻上见过的玩意\N{\reng}this thing on the news when I was a kid!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.92,1:08:33.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\reng}Okay, well...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.96,1:08:35.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,缩小范围\N{\reng}refine search.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.47,1:08:37.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出生日期\N{\reng}Date of birth.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.80,1:08:40.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不是在地球上出生的 是从外星来的\N{\reng}Wasn't born. He arrived.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.18,1:08:42.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里 快看\N{\reng}Oh, Barry, look!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.35,1:08:43.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我忙着呢\N{\reng}I'm busy.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.47,1:08:44.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,忙什么啊\N{\reng}With what?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.85,1:08:46.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在查过去这50年里\N{\reng}Looking for unidentified objects entering Earth's atmosphere
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.81,1:08:50.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从堪萨斯附近领空 进入地球大气层的不明地外物体\N{\reng}anywhere near Kansas in the last 50 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.69,1:08:52.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他这里能进入国家航天局系统\N{\reng}He has a back door into NASA.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.15,1:08:55.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是他\N{\reng}'Course he does.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.40,1:08:56.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 巴里\N{\reng}Yeah, but Barry,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.65,1:08:57.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看看这个嘛\N{\reng}check this out.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.91,1:08:59.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个小袋子会笑\N{\reng}This bag laughs.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.16,1:09:03.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行了 你能不能忙点正事\N{\reng}Okay, can't you take anything seriously?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.70,1:09:04.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别再瞎闹了\N{\reng}Stop messing around.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.08,1:09:06.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥们 拜托\N{\reng}Dude, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.83,1:09:09.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在这里四处转过没有\N{\reng}Have you seen this place?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.17,1:09:10.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的太酷了\N{\reng}It's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.46,1:09:11.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂\N{\reng}Hello!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.04,1:09:14.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在还不知道事态有多严重吗\N{\reng}Has the gravity of this not sunk in for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.84,1:09:16.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别再瞎闹了 巴里\N{\reng}Stop messing around, Barry.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.09,1:09:17.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是最后一次警告\N{\reng}I won't say it again.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.68,1:09:18.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是\N{\reng}Yeesh.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.34,1:09:20.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 老妈\N{\reng}Sorry, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.35,1:09:21.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\reng}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.43,1:09:22.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\reng}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.68,1:09:24.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你根本不知道自己有多幸运\N{\reng}You have no idea how lucky you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.68,1:09:25.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本不知道\N{\reng}No idea!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.93,1:09:27.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得一切都是理所当然的\N{\reng}You take everything for granted.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.31,1:09:28.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本不懂得感恩\N{\reng}You don't even appreciate...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.31,1:09:30.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一天到晚瞎晃\N{\reng}You just walk around thinking
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.44,1:09:33.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以为自己可幽默 可时髦了\N{\reng}that you're so funny and so cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.32,1:09:34.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真丢人\N{\reng}And it's embarrassing,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.65,1:09:35.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为其实\N{\reng}because
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.78,1:09:36.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你哪条都不沾\N{\reng}you're not any of those things!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.90,1:09:39.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你少来好吗\N{\reng}Hey, screw you, man!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.03,1:09:42.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我干的全是你让我干的事\N{\reng}I've done nothing but everything you've asked.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.45,1:09:44.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还害得我被闪电劈\N{\reng}You made me get struck by lightning!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.16,1:09:45.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我光着身子穿过了地板\N{\reng}I phased naked through the floor.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.66,1:09:47.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把约翰森夫人吓了个半死\N{\reng}And I terrified Mrs. Johannson.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.29,1:09:48.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没准我还得搬走\N{\reng}Now I'm probably gonna have to move.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.04,1:09:51.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你甚至都没告诉我你为什么会来这里\N{\reng}You won't even tell me why you're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.42,1:09:52.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你能不能告诉我 为什么\N{\reng}But will you at least tell me why
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.67,1:09:55.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无缘无故对我这么苛刻\N{\reng}you're being so mean to me... for no reason?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.34,1:09:57.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把小猴子当成飞镖靶子\N{\reng}You used Monkey as a dartboard!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.97,1:09:59.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 什么\N{\reng}Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.80,1:10:01.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了\N{\reng}Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.35,1:10:05.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小猴子 等等\N{\reng}The monkey? Wait...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.97,1:10:07.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟我发这么大火 就因为\N{\reng}So, you're mad at me
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.68,1:10:09.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我玩了一个玩具\N{\reng}for playing with a toy?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.56,1:10:10.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是普通玩具\N{\reng}It's not a toy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.48,1:10:12.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是妈妈买给我们的\N{\reng}Mom bought us that monkey.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.36,1:10:15.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为她就叫我们小猴子\N{\reng}'Cause she calls us Monkey.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.82,1:10:17.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还总是送我们和猴子有关的东西\N{\reng}She gives us monkey stuff all the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.53,1:10:19.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\reng}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.53,1:10:21.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个\N{\reng}Look...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.53,1:10:23.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\reng}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.91,1:10:27.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不太会和人相处\N{\reng}I'm not very good with people.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.16,1:10:29.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,包括我自己\N{\reng}Even myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.17,1:10:32.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事 哥们\N{\reng}Come on, dude.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.29,1:10:33.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你其实还好啦\N{\reng}You're... You're not that bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.04,1:10:36.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是有的时候烦人了一点儿 但是\N{\reng}You can just be kind of a dick sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.30,1:10:40.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说实话 我这人是挺招人讨厌的\N{\reng}But let's face it. I am pretty obnoxious.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.80,1:10:42.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我特别容易激动\N{\reng}But I just get excited.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.68,1:10:45.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啦 这地方真挺棒的 你说呢\N{\reng}Come on. This place is pretty cool, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.93,1:10:46.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\reng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.85,1:10:51.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我\N{\reng}All right, well, um...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.31,1:10:54.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不打扰你了\N{\reng}I'll let you work.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.54,1:11:15.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你在\N{\reng}I know you're there.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.80,1:11:19.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道我在想什么吗\N{\reng}You know what I'm stuck on?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.55,1:11:22.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在想你用意面打的那个比方\N{\reng}That thing you said, with the spaghetti.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.97,1:11:24.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你当时说 有些时空之间的交汇\N{\reng}You said there were certain intersections
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.43,1:11:25.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是避免不了的\N{\reng}that would always be inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.81,1:11:29.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿尔弗雷德当过你的助手\N{\reng}You had an Alfred.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.43,1:11:30.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我那边 他也是蝙蝠侠的助手\N{\reng}My Bruce has an Alfred.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.31,1:11:33.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世界不一样 时间也不一样\N{\reng}Different worlds, different times...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.44,1:11:35.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你看\N{\reng}yet there it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.73,1:11:37.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一些人\N{\reng}Certain people,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.90,1:11:38.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一些事\N{\reng}certain events,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.90,1:11:41.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有些意大利面\N{\reng}certain strands of spaghetti,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.65,1:11:44.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会像磁铁一样相互吸引\N{\reng}drawn to each other like... like magnets.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.28,1:11:46.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看了大量\N{\reng}I've read all about
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.66,1:11:50.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时间悖论和因果循环的资料 但是\N{\reng}temporal paradoxes and causal loops. But
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.91,1:11:52.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实比理论复杂\N{\reng}this is more than that.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.16,1:11:54.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时间线之间那些不可避免的交汇点\N{\reng}Inevitable intersections
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.67,1:11:56.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是任何理论都没法预测到的\N{\reng}are something none of the theories could have anticipated 'cause,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.42,1:11:59.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为 还能怎么解释呢 只能说是\N{\reng}well, how do you explain that except for...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.09,1:12:02.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,命运的安排\N{\reng}fate?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.97,1:12:04.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还在听吗\N{\reng}If you are listening,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.93,1:12:06.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你父母的事我很遗憾\N{\reng}sorry about your parents.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.30,1:12:08.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也只是想救我的父母\N{\reng}I'm just trying to save mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.68,1:12:11.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定会有办法的\N{\reng}There has to be a way.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.31,1:12:14.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定会有办法的 巴里\N{\reng}There is a way, Barry.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.94,1:12:16.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续 继续\N{\reng}Just keep trying. Keep trying, Barry.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.86,1:13:01.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他找到超人了\N{\reng}Found him.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.44,1:13:03.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里 你快醒醒\N{\reng}Barry, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.15,1:13:06.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克拉克被雇佣兵组织\N{\reng}Clark's being held by a mercenary group
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.15,1:13:07.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关在西伯利亚的秘密基地里\N{\reng}in a Siberian black site.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.32,1:13:09.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快起来 巴里\N{\reng}Get up, Barry.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.32,1:13:10.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,山羊身上着火了\N{\reng}The goat's on fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.53,1:13:12.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得去趟俄罗斯\N{\reng}We're going to Russia.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.58,1:13:15.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真好\N{\reng}Sweet.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.79,1:13:18.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有咖啡\N{\reng}Mm. Coffee.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.17,1:13:21.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们怎么去俄罗斯\N{\reng}How are we gonna get to Russia?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.92,1:14:00.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会帮你们找到超人\N{\reng}I'll help you get this Superman.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.29,1:14:03.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后 就要靠你们自己了\N{\reng}Then, you're on your own.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.84,1:14:07.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你\N{\reng}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.97,1:14:09.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是\N{\reng}You're...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.97,1:14:12.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是\N{\reng}You are, you're...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.43,1:14:17.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N{\reng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.44,1:14:20.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是蝙蝠侠\N{\reng}I'm Batman.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.28,1:15:09.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,计划是什么\N{\reng}So, what's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.57,1:15:11.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直接进去 拉上超人\N{\reng}We're just gonna, what, grab Superman
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.32,1:15:12.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在敌人发现之前跑掉\N{\reng}and dip set before the block is hot?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.82,1:15:13.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\reng}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.20,1:15:15.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你问问他\N{\reng}Hey, you should ask him.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.53,1:15:17.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去问他\N{\reng}You ask him.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.41,1:15:18.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去问他\N{\reng}You should ask him.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.29,1:15:19.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\reng}Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.16,1:15:19.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不问\N{\reng}I'm not gonna ask him.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.04,1:15:21.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么 我还以为他是你好朋友\N{\reng}Why not? I thought Batman was supposed to be your friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.58,1:15:23.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又不是他 不是这个蝙蝠侠\N{\reng}Not this one. Not this Batman.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.42,1:15:24.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们到了\N{\reng}We're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.29,1:15:26.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,启动悬停模式\N{\reng}Activating hover mode.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.22,1:15:32.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打开弹射座椅\N{\reng}Ejector seat on.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.55,1:15:33.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弹射座椅\N{\reng}Ejector seat.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.59,1:15:34.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弹射座椅\N{\reng}Ejector seat.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.43,1:15:40.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 弹射还分步骤\N{\reng}Okay, there are stages.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.69,1:15:44.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们身后都备了降落伞\N{\reng}You're strapped to your parachutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.98,1:15:48.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的伞呢\N{\reng}Hey, where's yours?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.70,1:16:01.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这也太酷啦\N{\reng}This rips dicks!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.85,1:16:22.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切正常 我们走\N{\reng}All clear. Let's move.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.28,1:16:39.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要啊\N{\reng}Okay!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.29,1:16:50.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行 你们速度都快 就我慢\N{\reng}Good. Everybody's fast now but me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.92,1:16:52.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么这么冷\N{\reng}Why is it so cold?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.30,1:16:53.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是北极 巴里\N{\reng} - It's the Arctic, Barry.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.43,1:16:57.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他人呢\N{\reng}Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.34,1:16:59.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道 跟着脚印走就是了\N{\reng}I don't know. Just follow the footprints.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.23,1:17:05.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超人肯定就在下面\N{\reng}Superman would be down there for sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.06,1:17:50.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被发现了\N{\reng}Yeah. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.05,1:18:18.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你干什么了\N{\reng}What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.93,1:18:20.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我移动了你 不过\N{\reng}I had to move you. But
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.30,1:18:21.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没动多少\N{\reng}I just did it a little.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.19,1:18:31.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能会很疼\N{\reng}This might hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.15,1:18:41.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吐出来就好了\N{\reng}Just let it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.40,1:19:19.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\reng}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.33,1:19:28.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超人就被关在这里\N{\reng}That's where you keep Superman.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.54,1:19:30.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像一颗大铁蛋\N{\reng}Like a big scrotum.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.68,1:19:46.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他要用这台翻盖手机黑进苏联的网络安全系统\N{\reng}He's gonna hack the Soviet security cyberscrotum with a flip phone?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.06,1:19:52.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把所有密码都试了一遍\N{\reng}I tried all the combinations.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.56,1:19:56.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成了\N{\reng}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.61,1:20:39.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\reng}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.03,1:20:42.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡尔-艾尔\N{\reng}Kal-El?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.90,1:20:45.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是他\N{\reng}It's not him.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.16,1:20:47.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得走了\N{\reng}We've gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.16,1:20:48.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等\N{\reng}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.03,1:20:50.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能丢下她 她都这样了\N{\reng}We can't just leave her here. Look at her.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.79,1:20:54.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来抱她 快走\N{\reng}I'll grab her. Just go!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.30,1:21:03.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有我在呢\N{\reng}I got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.03,1:21:23.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来收拾这个蠢货\N{\reng}I'll handle this jabroni.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.78,1:21:30.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\reng}What the...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.96,1:21:39.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里\N{\reng}Barry!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.92,1:21:40.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我中弹了\N{\reng}Somebody shot me!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.05,1:21:47.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得赶紧跑\N{\reng}Time to dip set!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.81,1:21:57.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（俄语）快把人放下\N{\reng}You, you lead the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.60,1:22:00.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 别推我 别往下推\N{\reng}-Go! -Not that way! Not that way!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.91,1:22:13.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\reng}Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.79,1:22:14.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隐蔽\N{\reng}Cover!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.68,1:22:31.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要掉下来了 要下来了\N{\reng}It's coming around.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.05,1:22:32.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快啊 快啊\N{\reng}Hurry, hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.85,1:22:43.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 别推我\N{\reng}No, no, no! This is bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.16,1:22:54.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\reng}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.66,1:22:55.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起来\N{\reng}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.54,1:22:57.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走\N{\reng}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.54,1:23:01.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你根本没告诉我会中枪\N{\reng}You didn't tell me we could get shot!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.17,1:23:02.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你凭什么觉得我们不会中枪\N{\reng}Why would you assume we couldn't?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.05,1:23:17.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好极了 我要死在苏联卫星脚下了\N{\reng}Oh, great! To die at the feet of a Sputnik.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.44,1:23:24.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大哥 我这膝盖还得用呢\N{\reng}Oh, man! I need this knee!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.36,1:23:25.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,淡定 会自愈的\N{\reng}Stay calm. It'll heal.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.61,1:23:26.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点儿\N{\reng}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.41,1:23:40.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你体重多少公斤\N{\reng}How much do you weigh?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.29,1:23:42.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,81公斤 他也是 加上她是199公斤\N{\reng}180. Each. Plus her, 440.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.34,1:23:50.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓稳了\N{\reng}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.70,1:24:22.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死 他们追上来了 这边也来人了\N{\reng}Oh, great. They're here. They're over here, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.21,1:24:24.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯米诺冰纯 对 斯米诺冰纯\N{\reng}Smirnoff Ice. Yes. Smirnoff Ice.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.21,1:24:28.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们动真格了 巴里 闭嘴\N{\reng}Okay, they're serious. Barry, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.96,1:24:29.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\reng}Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.17,1:24:31.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么办\N{\reng}What's the play?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.17,1:24:32.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蝙蝠侠 我们现在怎么办\N{\reng}Batman, what do we do? What now?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.05,1:24:38.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在\N{\reng}Now...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.06,1:24:40.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得先保命\N{\reng}we try not to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.58,1:25:42.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才那些要是有慢镜头就好了\N{\reng}Oh, you guys should've seen that in slo-mo.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.53,1:26:22.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才意识到这么做有点儿欠考虑了\N{\reng}Yeah, I'm just realizing that I didn't really think this through.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.78,1:26:24.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然氪星有好人\N{\reng}There are good Kryptonians...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.41,1:26:26.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但那里同样也不缺十恶不赦的坏蛋\N{\reng}and then there are very, very bad Kryptonians.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.41,1:26:29.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当时信心十足地认为我们能在那里找到超人\N{\reng}And I was very confident that we were just gonna find Superman,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.96,1:26:31.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我们真的找到了超人\N{\reng}and if we found Superman,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.92,1:26:33.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那这一切就都迎刃而解了\N{\reng}then this would all be super simple.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.80,1:26:35.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你们是谁 - 我的天啊\N{\reng}- Who are you? - Holy Funyuns.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.47,1:26:38.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好\N{\reng}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.55,1:26:40.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我是巴里 - 我俩都是\N{\reng}-I... I'm Barry. -We're Barry.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.09,1:26:43.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们本来要找卡尔-艾尔\N{\reng}We were trying to find Kal-El.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.68,1:26:45.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但最后我们只找到了你\N{\reng}But we found you instead.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.56,1:26:46.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们找卡尔-艾尔干什么\N{\reng}What do you want with Kal-El?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.18,1:26:48.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们想救他出来\N{\reng}We were trying to rescue him.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.73,1:26:49.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\reng}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.56,1:26:52.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为他是我朋友\N{\reng}Because he's my friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.44,1:26:54.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认识他吗\N{\reng}Do you... Do you know him?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.82,1:26:56.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她好像火了 准备好\N{\reng}She looks mad. Get ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.57,1:26:59.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她会使用镭射眼 还会吹超级冷的冻气\N{\reng}She might do laser vision, or she might do, like, a freezy breath...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.40,1:27:01.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也可能直接乱扔东西\N{\reng}or she'll just start throwing crazy...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.16,1:27:02.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的名字叫卡拉\N{\reng}My name is Kara.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.78,1:27:04.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐-艾尔之女\N{\reng}Daughter of Zor-El.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.03,1:27:06.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡尔-艾尔是我堂弟\N{\reng}Kal-El was my cousin.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.54,1:27:08.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 卡尔-艾尔是谁来着\N{\reng}Right, and who's Kal-El again?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.20,1:27:09.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是超人\N{\reng}It's Superman.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.08,1:27:10.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 你之前说他叫克拉克\N{\reng}No, 'cause you said that was Clark.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.79,1:27:11.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克拉克是谁\N{\reng}Who's Clark?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.83,1:27:14.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克拉克 是他在地球的名字\N{\reng}Clark is his human name.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.04,1:27:16.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克拉克\N{\reng}Clark.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.22,1:27:20.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们离开家时他还是个婴儿\N{\reng}He was an infant when we left.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.55,1:27:24.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后的氪星之子 而我\N{\reng}The last son of Krypton... I...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.06,1:27:27.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我奉命保护他\N{\reng}I was sent to protect him.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.93,1:27:30.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看样子在这个宇宙中他根本没有来到地球\N{\reng}It looks like he never made it to Earth in this universe.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.56,1:27:33.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们两个的救生艇肯定是分开了\N{\reng}Our pods, they must have separated.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.98,1:27:35.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 你觉得一个小婴儿\N{\reng}Wait, so you thought a baby
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.73,1:27:38.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以帮我们对抗这个叫佐德的家伙\N{\reng}was gonna protect us from this Zod guy?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.32,1:27:39.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐德将军到这儿来了\N{\reng}General Zod is here.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.90,1:27:41.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定是追踪救生艇的信号来的\N{\reng}He must have tracked my pod's signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.91,1:27:43.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得走了\N{\reng}I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.41,1:27:44.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等会儿\N{\reng}Whoa, whoa, wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.57,1:27:46.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个 你需要恢复一下体力\N{\reng}Well, you need to recover your strength.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.66,1:27:47.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样 巴里\N{\reng}Actually, Barry...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.04,1:27:49.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你带她去屋顶\N{\reng}take her to the roof
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.54,1:27:51.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让她在阳光下晒一会儿\N{\reng}and put her in the sun.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.54,1:27:52.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\reng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.79,1:27:54.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 这完全没有问题\N{\reng}-Yeah. -Whatever, like if, I mean,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.83,1:27:56.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以用阳光充能\N{\reng}you're solar powered.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.54,1:27:57.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真了不起 我一直试着\N{\reng}Good for you. I've been trying to...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.84,1:28:03.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我帮你拿着\N{\reng}We'll take that with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.10,1:28:14.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在能\N{\reng}Um, am I cool to...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.81,1:28:15.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,转过去了吗\N{\reng}turn around?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.94,1:28:18.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在穿的是\N{\reng}Are you dressed
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.90,1:28:20.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,红色披风\N{\reng}in a red cape?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.03,1:28:29.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还能悬空\N{\reng}You're levitating?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.67,1:28:38.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里一直这么吵吗\N{\reng}Is it always this loud?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.96,1:28:42.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里很吵吗\N{\reng}Is it loud?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.97,1:28:46.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你感觉怎么样 体力有没有\N{\reng}Are you, uh, good? Do you feel, um...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.18,1:28:47.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恢复一点儿\N{\reng}strong yet, or...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.31,1:28:55.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 看起来就很强大\N{\reng}Yep, that seems, uh,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.94,1:28:56.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那什么\N{\reng}seems strong. You know...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.81,1:28:59.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才下边那个老巴里\N{\reng}old man Barry, down there,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.23,1:29:01.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说如果我们不去阻止佐德队长\N{\reng}says if we don't stop Captain Zode,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.57,1:29:03.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会害死成千上万的人\N{\reng}he'll kill thousands of people.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.95,1:29:05.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是数十亿人\N{\reng}Billions of people.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.45,1:29:06.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,数十亿吗\N{\reng}Billions?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.16,1:29:09.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球上的人\N{\reng}Of your people.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.33,1:29:10.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是好人\N{\reng}They're good people.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.29,1:29:11.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好人\N{\reng}Good people?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.45,1:29:14.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来到这个星球\N{\reng}We came to this planet
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.08,1:29:16.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想找一个地方避难\N{\reng}looking for a safe place to live,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.29,1:29:17.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可他们却把我关进了牢笼\N{\reng}and they put me in a cage.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.42,1:29:20.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 地球上确实有很多坏人\N{\reng}Yeah. A lot of humans are dicks.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.17,1:29:22.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 地球上\N{\reng}But then
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.92,1:29:26.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有小宝宝和芭蕾舞演员\N{\reng}there's babies and ballerinas.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.30,1:29:27.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有娱乐摔跤手\N{\reng}And entertainment wrestlers.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.80,1:29:29.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有很多人值得被拯救\N{\reng}A lot of humans are worth saving.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.31,1:29:31.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是你认为\N{\reng}Maybe to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.81,1:29:34.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是地球人\N{\reng}But I'm not a human.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.60,1:29:36.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是氪星人\N{\reng}I'm a Kryptonian.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.69,1:29:41.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她走了\N{\reng}She's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.53,1:29:44.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我必须重获超能力\N{\reng}I have to get my powers back.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.03,1:29:49.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是能重演那次赋予我能力的意外\N{\reng}If I can re-create the accident that gave me my powers...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.32,1:29:51.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许我可以重获神速力的青睐\N{\reng}maybe I can reconnect to the Speed Force...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.16,1:29:53.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那样我们就有机会对抗佐德了\N{\reng}and maybe we'd stand a chance against Zod.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.29,1:29:56.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者 你会在这个过程中丧命\N{\reng}Or kill yourself in the process.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.79,1:30:00.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我说说吧\N{\reng}Tell me something.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.42,1:30:04.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你真的重获超能力\N{\reng}If you get your powers back,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.55,1:30:05.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你哪儿都能去\N{\reng}you can go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.97,1:30:08.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如另一条时间线 另一个宇宙\N{\reng}You can go to another timeline, another universe.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.97,1:30:10.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么要留下\N{\reng}Why do you wanna stay...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.18,1:30:12.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为守护这个世界而战\N{\reng}and fight to save this one?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.56,1:30:15.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我的妈妈活在这个世界里\N{\reng}Because this is the world where my mom lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.06,1:30:21.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我穿越时空就是为了救她\N{\reng}I went back in time to save her.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.73,1:30:23.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我绝不能再次失去她\N{\reng}I'm not gonna lose her again.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.03,1:30:25.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那孩子不知道吧\N{\reng}The kid doesn't know, does he?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.69,1:30:27.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种事情要怎么跟他说\N{\reng}How do you tell someone something like that?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.16,1:30:34.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我失去了我的父母 但是\N{\reng}I lost my parents... but
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.08,1:30:38.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那种痛苦\N{\reng}that pain...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.29,1:30:43.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,造就了我\N{\reng}made me who I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.84,1:30:46.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有那种经历 我也许会迷失自我\N{\reng}I'm not sure I know who I am without it, actually.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.84,1:30:52.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我大半辈子\N{\reng}I spent a lifetime...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.68,1:30:56.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都在试图纠正过去的错误\N{\reng}trying to right the wrongs of the past.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.81,1:30:58.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就好像\N{\reng}As if
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.81,1:31:01.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,披着个斗篷打击犯罪\N{\reng}putting on a cape and fighting crime
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.98,1:31:03.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就能让我和父母重聚\N{\reng}would bring my parents back.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.78,1:31:11.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可你做到了\N{\reng}You actually did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.32,1:31:13.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来\N{\reng}So...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.03,1:31:15.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的计划就是\N{\reng}I guess the plan is
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.45,1:31:17.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,泼自己一身化学试剂的同时\N{\reng}to douse yourself in industrial chemicals
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.91,1:31:19.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电击你自己\N{\reng}while electrocuting yourself?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.79,1:31:20.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N{\reng}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.92,1:31:26.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要帮忙吗\N{\reng}Want some help?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.09,1:31:30.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 我很需要你的帮助\N{\reng}Hell yeah. That would be incredibly useful.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.43,1:31:32.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实我已经拿了你一些药剂\N{\reng}I've actually already borrowed some chemicals
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.18,1:31:33.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有你的焊铁和耐热垫\N{\reng}and your soldering iron,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.34,1:31:35.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还坐在你的专座上\N{\reng}and I'm sitting in your bat-seat.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.56,1:31:37.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是有点儿不礼貌啊\N{\reng}Is that like a faux pas?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.90,1:31:52.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,W号机 L号机 Z号机 请注意\N{\reng}Wilco, Lima, Zebra, be advised...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.03,1:31:58.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,指挥部呼叫B-601号驾驶员\N{\reng}Air Command to Bravo 601.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.29,1:32:00.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主力编队 请确认管控范围\N{\reng}Primary teams, please confirm your AORs.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.31,1:32:24.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你竟然空手而来\N{\reng}You bring me nothing?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.19,1:32:28.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我警告过你们\N{\reng}I gave you a warning.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.69,1:32:32.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是你们不能把那个氪星叛徒交给我们\N{\reng}Your failure to deliver the Kryptonian traitor
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.78,1:32:34.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就会被视为对我们宣战\N{\reng}is being taken as an act of war.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.28,1:32:37.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开火 开火 开火\N{\reng}Fire, fire, fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.53,1:32:39.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,武器准备就绪 开火\N{\reng}Weapons hot! Weapons hot! Open fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.04,1:32:41.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要\N{\reng}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.07,1:33:15.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 等我拉动开关\N{\reng}Okay, when I throw the switch,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.28,1:33:19.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电流应该就会通过电线 把闪电直接引到风筝上面\N{\reng}the current should run up the wire and draw the lightning right to the kite.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.16,1:33:20.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给 把这个穿上\N{\reng}Here, put that on.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.66,1:33:22.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它不仅耐热 而且能防撞\N{\reng}It's heat and impact resistant.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.45,1:33:23.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一点儿保护措施\N{\reng}Should protect you a little.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.58,1:33:25.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关键就在于我不能有任何保护措施\N{\reng}Right, but the point is for me to not be protected.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.67,1:33:28.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\reng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.34,1:33:32.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得离远一点儿\N{\reng}You're gonna need to be out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.05,1:33:34.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\reng}I will.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.43,1:33:39.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该上电刑了\N{\reng}Let's get electrocuted.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.31,1:33:46.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会成功的 对吧\N{\reng}This is going to work, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.94,1:33:48.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然会成功的\N{\reng}Of course it's gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.69,1:33:50.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之前又不是没试过\N{\reng}Nothing we haven't done before.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.44,1:33:52.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次还有蝙蝠侠帮忙\N{\reng}Besides, this time we have Batman.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.32,1:33:53.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题的\N{\reng}What could go wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.40,1:33:55.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,郑重声明 我觉得这很荒唐\N{\reng}Uh, for the record, I think this is insane.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.78,1:33:58.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离远点儿\N{\reng}Get back.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.54,1:34:05.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的 没事\N{\reng}It's fine. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.55,1:34:17.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们又见面了 闪电先生\N{\reng}Just you and me again, Mr. Lightning.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.35,1:34:25.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动手\N{\reng}Do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.54,1:34:49.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 什么 不好\N{\reng}Wait, what? No!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.29,1:34:50.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 等等 停下\N{\reng}No, wait! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.67,1:34:51.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停下\N{\reng}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.17,1:34:59.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\reng}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.72,1:35:00.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\reng}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.84,1:35:02.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里 不要\N{\reng}Barry, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.85,1:35:06.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再来一次\N{\reng}Go again.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.73,1:35:08.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是\N{\reng}But...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.10,1:35:10.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\reng}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.28,1:35:19.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电路烧坏了\N{\reng}The circuit is fried.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.92,1:36:19.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来帮你\N{\reng}I've got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.91,1:36:51.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂\N{\reng}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.29,1:36:53.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里\N{\reng}Barry.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.67,1:36:56.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟上次一样没事 对吧\N{\reng}You're okay. It's like last time, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.92,1:36:58.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你快点儿自愈啊\N{\reng}So, you gotta heal now.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.19,1:37:17.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看 快看\N{\reng}Look, look, look!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.44,1:37:18.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以了 成功了\N{\reng}It's working. It's working.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.94,1:37:20.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 成功了\N{\reng}Yeah, it's working. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.44,1:37:22.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 他正在自愈\N{\reng}Yeah, he's healing. He's healing.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.65,1:37:24.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢天谢地 他没事\N{\reng}Oh, my God. He's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.15,1:37:26.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兄弟 你知不知道你差点儿把我吓死\N{\reng}Dude, you scared the shit out of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.78,1:38:11.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你醒了\N{\reng}You're awake.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.45,1:38:13.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉如何\N{\reng}How you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.41,1:38:15.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很慢\N{\reng}Slow.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.16,1:38:17.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许这个能帮你\N{\reng}Maybe this will help.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.47,1:38:31.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完美\N{\reng}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.47,1:38:32.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太酷了 兄弟\N{\reng}Dude, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.68,1:38:33.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太酷了\N{\reng}Irresistible!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.97,1:38:35.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 重获力量太棒了\N{\reng}Man, feels good to be back.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.73,1:38:36.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然\N{\reng}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.06,1:38:38.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过你穿的这是什么\N{\reng}And what are we wearing tonight?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.69,1:38:39.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喜欢吗\N{\reng}You like it?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.56,1:38:41.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我用蝙蝠侠的那套旧战服改的\N{\reng}I-I made it myself out of that old Batsuit.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.94,1:38:44.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,改成了咱们战服的颜色和款式\N{\reng}But you know, I made it our colors and everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.19,1:38:45.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 你看这个\N{\reng}Well, check this out!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.15,1:38:48.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这身比较宽松\N{\reng}It's a bit more loose.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.70,1:38:51.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爆炫\N{\reng}It beeves.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.83,1:38:53.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兄弟\N{\reng}Dude...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.58,1:38:55.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真这么觉得吗\N{\reng}you really mean that?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.79,1:38:56.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说实话\N{\reng}I mean, I don't...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.29,1:39:00.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实我不知道“爆炫”是什么意思\N{\reng}I don't know what it means, exactly, to beeve.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.04,1:39:03.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过听起来是个好词\N{\reng}But it seems like it's positive.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.71,1:39:04.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么了\N{\reng}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.67,1:39:08.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你回来了\N{\reng}You came back.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.97,1:39:10.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很高兴你没事\N{\reng}I'm glad you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.09,1:39:12.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有个问题想问你\N{\reng}I have to ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.81,1:39:16.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在我被囚禁的地方找到我的时候\N{\reng}When you found me in that hole that they put me in...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.68,1:39:19.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发现我不是卡尔-艾尔\N{\reng}and I wasn't Kal-El...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.86,1:39:23.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么还要帮我\N{\reng}why did you help me?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.82,1:39:25.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你需要帮助\N{\reng}Because you needed help.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.15,1:39:30.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道这个符号代表什么吗\N{\reng}Do you know what this symbol stands for?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.78,1:39:32.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超级少女\N{\reng}Supergirl?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.07,1:39:33.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是希望 对吧\N{\reng}It means hope, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.41,1:39:34.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望 对 是希望吗\N{\reng}Hope, yeah. Does it mean hope?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.45,1:39:38.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,氪星是一个美丽的星球\N{\reng}Krypton was a beautiful place.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.29,1:39:41.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的特质是希望\N{\reng}We are a people of hope,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.67,1:39:43.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是战争\N{\reng}not war.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.84,1:39:48.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是来自大都会的直播 就在几分钟之前\N{\reng}I'm coming to you live from Metropolis, where minutes ago, the mysterious flying...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.97,1:39:50.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐德虽然是氪星人\N{\reng}Zod may be from Krypton,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.18,1:39:53.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他绝对不能代表我们\N{\reng}but he is not my people.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.85,1:39:56.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你的意思是\N{\reng}So, you're saying...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.31,1:39:57.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\reng}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.93,1:39:59.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会帮你们对抗佐德\N{\reng}I will help you fight Zod.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.44,1:40:03.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\reng}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.31,1:40:05.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这队伍有点儿意思\N{\reng}Interesting group.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.44,1:40:08.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你之前说\N{\reng}What did you say, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.03,1:40:10.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们叫什么来着\N{\reng}we were called again?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.45,1:40:12.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是正义联盟\N{\reng}We're the Justice League.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.41,1:40:13.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不对\N{\reng}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.45,1:40:14.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不对吗 - 不过\N{\reng}-No? -Well,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.78,1:40:16.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也算是吧\N{\reng}I mean, kinda.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.58,1:40:18.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还缺\N{\reng}We are short
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.66,1:40:19.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个真正的女神\N{\reng}one literal goddess...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.04,1:40:21.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个笑面终结者\N{\reng}one friendly Terminator
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.79,1:40:23.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个超级人鱼\N{\reng}and super mermaid.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.17,1:40:26.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然蝙蝠侠也是必不可少的\N{\reng}And we could definitely use a Batman.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.67,1:40:30.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你来吗\N{\reng}Are you in?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.18,1:40:37.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想大干一场\N{\reng}You wanna get nuts?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:39.68,1:40:41.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就来吧\N{\reng}Let's get nuts.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.41,1:40:57.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我来的世界 佐德一召唤超人就立刻现身了\N{\reng}In my world, Superman showed up right away when Zod called him out.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.16,1:40:59.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以说我也不知道接下来会发生什么\N{\reng}So, as of now, we're in uncharted territory.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.66,1:41:00.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我知道\N{\reng}What I do know is
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.58,1:41:02.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐德以某种方式控制着创世引擎\N{\reng}that Zod somehow controls the World Engines,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.83,1:41:03.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它的破坏力非常惊人\N{\reng}which will be destroying much more
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.96,1:41:05.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们每晚一秒阻止他\N{\reng}than just Metropolis now
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.71,1:41:07.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就能摧毁一座规模相当于大都会的城市\N{\reng}with every passing second that we don't stop him.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.71,1:41:08.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里 你在干什么\N{\reng}Barry, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.92,1:41:09.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\reng}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.46,1:41:12.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咱们的孩子们肯定想看\N{\reng}Our kids are gonna wanna see this.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.05,1:41:14.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有孩子\N{\reng}Your kids?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.18,1:41:17.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说所有的孩子\N{\reng}Well, you know, like everybody's kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.80,1:41:19.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全世界所有的小孩儿\N{\reng}I mean, the children of the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.43,1:41:20.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们肯定想看\N{\reng}They're gonna wanna see this.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.18,1:41:24.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们马上就到了\N{\reng}We're getting close.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.44,1:41:26.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我负责空中作战 消灭他们的空中力量\N{\reng}I'm gonna stay airborne and take out their sky power.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.98,1:41:27.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里 这也就意味着\N{\reng}And Barry, just so we're clear
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.06,1:41:31.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和我两个人要对抗地面上的整个氪星人大军\N{\reng}what that essentially equates to is you and me versus the entire Kryptonian army.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.53,1:41:32.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\reng}Chill.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.57,1:41:34.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要给卡拉争取时间 让她击败佐德\N{\reng}We need to buy Kara enough time to take out Zod.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.78,1:41:38.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别忘了你的战服不能像我的一样耗散能量\N{\reng}Oh, and remember that your suit doesn't dissipate energy like mine
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.07,1:41:41.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你不能一直跑 否则会积累过多的电荷\N{\reng}so you need to take breaks, otherwise you're gonna build up too much charge.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.41,1:41:42.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 什么\N{\reng}Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.31,1:42:04.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓稳\N{\reng}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.06,1:42:08.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稳住\N{\reng}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.94,1:42:11.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是我们要保护的人吗\N{\reng}The humans we came to protect?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.73,1:42:13.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不知道我们是友军\N{\reng}They don't know we're on their side.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.60,1:42:49.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐德\N{\reng}Zod.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.95,1:43:00.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡拉佐-艾尔\N{\reng}Kara Zor-El.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.41,1:43:01.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于把你等来了\N{\reng}We've been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.46,1:43:14.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 把他拖走 - 你上 我来掩护\N{\reng}-Drag him out, drag him! -You go! I'll cover!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.69,1:43:34.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下 那个来自太空的巨怪\N{\reng}Okay, and the space giant...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.44,1:43:38.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有那个女杀人狂 也要我们对付吗\N{\reng}and Mistress Murder... are our responsibility, too?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.32,1:43:39.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别去想他们 冷静下来\N{\reng}Don't think about them, okay? Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.78,1:43:41.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们先解决那边的敌人\N{\reng}We're just gonna start with those guys over there.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.53,1:43:43.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 他们都是氪星人 我们干不掉\N{\reng}And yeah, they're Kryptonian, and we won't be able to kill them,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.70,1:43:45.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们可以帮卡拉拖住他们\N{\reng}but we can slow them down for her.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.54,1:43:46.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个一个来\N{\reng}One at a time.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.66,1:43:48.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\reng}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.54,1:43:50.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先去打掉他们的武器 然后你再上\N{\reng}I'm gonna disarm them, and then you'll engage.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.83,1:43:53.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,揍他们\N{\reng}Punch 'em.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.42,1:43:56.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧 芭比\N{\reng}Come on, Barbie.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.34,1:43:58.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去派对狂欢\N{\reng}Let's go party?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.10,1:44:07.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕\N{\reng}Okay, ow!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.94,1:44:16.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 没事了\N{\reng}Okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.86,1:44:18.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事 快起来\N{\reng}You're okay. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.40,1:44:20.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 他们太快了\N{\reng}Jesus, they're fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.15,1:44:21.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 但是不如我们快\N{\reng}Yes, but not as fast as us.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.41,1:44:27.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球的改造已经开始\N{\reng}Terraforming has begun.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.45,1:44:29.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有这个世界灭亡\N{\reng}This world must die
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.16,1:44:31.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们那个世界才能重生\N{\reng}so that ours may live again.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.34,1:44:40.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好 我们快走 快走\N{\reng}Oh, my God. We gotta go. We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.72,1:44:41.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丹尼 走\N{\reng}Dan, Danny, go,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.84,1:44:42.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走\N{\reng}go!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.84,1:44:46.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,氪星已经灭亡了 佐德\N{\reng}Krypton is gone, Zod.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.18,1:44:47.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的叔叔\N{\reng}Your uncle...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.56,1:44:48.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔-艾尔\N{\reng}Jor-El...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.06,1:44:51.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把氪星\N{\reng}hid the key
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.56,1:44:53.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能够重生的关键\N{\reng}to Krypton's rebirth
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.10,1:44:56.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,藏在了一个氪星孩子身上\N{\reng}inside a Kryptonian child.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:56.48,1:44:59.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他把重启氪星生命所必需的基因资料\N{\reng}All the genetic material needed to start again
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.78,1:45:02.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,编码进了他的DNA\N{\reng}coded inside the DNA,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.65,1:45:05.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后用逃生舱 把他送来了地球\N{\reng}then sent to Earth in an escape pod.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.41,1:45:07.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不在这里 你已经失败了\N{\reng}He's not here. You have failed.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.45,1:45:09.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们找到他了\N{\reng}We found him.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.41,1:45:13.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们拦截了他的逃生舱\N{\reng}We intercepted his pod.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.79,1:45:18.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你那个堂弟并不是我们要找的人\N{\reng}But your cousin was not the one we needed.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.09,1:45:21.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你才是那个人\N{\reng}You are the one.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.42,1:45:23.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡拉佐-艾尔\N{\reng}Kara Zor-El.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.84,1:45:25.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们需要的\N{\reng}It is your blood...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.93,1:45:27.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你的血液\N{\reng}we must harvest.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.18,1:45:28.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们把卡尔-艾尔怎么了\N{\reng}What did you do to Kal-El?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.60,1:45:31.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的牺牲将会让我们的氪星\N{\reng}Your sacrifice that will allow
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.31,1:45:33.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重获新生\N{\reng}Krypton to live again.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.43,1:45:35.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们到底做了什么\N{\reng}What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:38.31,1:45:39.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个孩子\N{\reng}The infant did
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.44,1:45:41.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并没有活下来\N{\reng}not survive.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:14.60,1:46:15.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 新计划\N{\reng}Look, new plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.94,1:46:17.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来制造一阵龙卷风\N{\reng}I'm gonna create a cyclonic diversion.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.56,1:46:19.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后你发动进攻 用全力\N{\reng}And you're gonna just come in, hard.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:19.44,1:46:20.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次直接用脚踹\N{\reng}Feet first this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:36.29,1:46:37.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,漂亮\N{\reng}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:38.17,1:46:39.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里 你看到了吗\N{\reng}Barry, did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.58,1:46:41.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心 你积累的电荷太多了\N{\reng}Be careful. You're accumulating too much charge.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.84,1:46:45.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是我发射电流攻击这家伙呢\N{\reng}What if I just Emperor this guy?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:46.30,1:46:47.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 快住手\N{\reng}No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.16,1:47:17.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里 刚才那招并没有我想的那么蠢\N{\reng}Barry, that was actually only half stupid!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.79,1:47:19.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 如果你想活着继续用那招\N{\reng}But if you're gonna do that and not die,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:19.79,1:47:21.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你需要想办法组成电回路\N{\reng}you need to complete the circuit somehow.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.42,1:47:23.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,试着把手放在一起 像这样\N{\reng}Try putting your hands together, like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.71,1:47:27.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了\N{\reng}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.68,1:47:30.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以的\N{\reng}You're ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.55,1:47:32.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冲啊\N{\reng}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.48,1:47:46.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好像遇到了一点儿麻烦\N{\reng}? I seem to think I think I got a little situation ?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:46.32,1:47:47.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以听我说\N{\reng}? So listen to me,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.65,1:47:49.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许你能帮上忙\N{\reng}sister Listen maybe you can help ?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.40,1:47:52.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我对许多问题都有自己的思考\N{\reng}? I think I gave a lot of Problems my consideration ?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.28,1:47:55.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我似乎总在为别人考虑\N{\reng}? But not for me It always seem to be For someone else ?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.16,1:47:57.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么其他人好像总在休假\N{\reng}? Why all the people always Seem to just be on vacation ?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:57.83,1:48:00.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得到什么好处了吗 什么都没有\N{\reng}? What do I get from it I don't get anything at all ?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.96,1:48:03.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就像一个装着各种负能量的垃圾桶\N{\reng}? I'm like a trash can Holding all the information ?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.84,1:48:06.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种感觉让我无地自容\N{\reng}? And every single time It leaves me Feeling two feet tall ?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.47,1:48:18.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有一种答案 只有一种答案\N{\reng}? And only one I'm taking ?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.17,1:48:50.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去对付那个大家伙\N{\reng}I'm going after the big one.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.85,1:49:02.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我被击中了\N{\reng}I've been hit.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:05.56,1:49:06.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布鲁斯 能听到吗\N{\reng}Bruce, do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.48,1:49:08.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡拉呢\N{\reng}Where's Kara?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.44,1:49:09.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你快去找她\N{\reng}You go find her.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.16,1:49:15.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布鲁斯\N{\reng}Bruce!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:16.28,1:49:20.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弹射模式 故障\N{\reng}Ejection mode failure. Ejection mode failure.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.03,1:50:01.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安息吧 卡拉佐-艾尔\N{\reng}Rest, Kara Zor-El.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.29,1:50:08.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要坠毁了\N{\reng}Going down.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:13.67,1:50:14.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我还要拉个垫背的\N{\reng}But I'm not going alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:14.97,1:50:16.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不要\N{\reng}No, no, no,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:16.22,1:50:17.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布鲁斯\N{\reng}Bruce!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.47,1:50:19.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布鲁斯 快弹射\N{\reng}Bruce, eject!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:19.30,1:50:20.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布鲁斯 赶紧弹\N{\reng}Bruce, just eject...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.81,1:50:28.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\reng}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:40.66,1:50:41.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡拉\N{\reng}Kara.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.04,1:50:50.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种事不应该\N{\reng}Isn't supposed...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.05,1:50:53.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不应该发生的\N{\reng}Not supposed to happen...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.68,1:51:00.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡拉死了\N{\reng}Kara's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.22,1:51:02.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们都死了\N{\reng}They're both dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:02.60,1:51:03.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但还有办法 对吧\N{\reng}But they don't have to be, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.60,1:51:06.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我们可以穿越\N{\reng}'Cause we can go back.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.06,1:51:08.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像你之前那样\N{\reng}Like you did.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.19,1:51:09.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的速度还不够快\N{\reng}You're not fast enough yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.44,1:51:10.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\reng}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.32,1:51:14.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里\N{\reng}Barry!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:15.69,1:51:17.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里 等等\N{\reng}Barry, wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.54,1:51:31.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到这儿够了吗\N{\reng}Is this back enough?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.34,1:51:33.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得够了\N{\reng}Yeah, I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:40.18,1:51:41.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 巴里 我\N{\reng}Listen, Barry, I...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:43.05,1:51:44.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\reng}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:44.35,1:51:46.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的 我们肯定能搞定\N{\reng}It's okay. We can fix this.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.31,1:51:49.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道怎么做吗 我已经想好做什么了\N{\reng}You know what you're gonna change? I know what I'm gonna change.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.69,1:51:56.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去对付那个大家伙\N{\reng}I'm going after the big one.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.78,1:52:01.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布鲁斯 先别打 那艘战舰外面有护盾\N{\reng}Bruce, pull off. That gunship is shield-protected.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:01.16,1:52:02.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收到\N{\reng}Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:05.70,1:52:06.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他肯定没有\N{\reng}Bet he's not.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.70,1:52:08.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁\N{\reng}Who?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:08.66,1:52:09.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个太空巨怪\N{\reng}Space giant?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.71,1:52:11.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 赶紧把他干掉\N{\reng}Yes, yes, please take him out.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:52.83,1:52:53.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\reng}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.45,1:54:54.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别\N{\reng}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.04,1:54:58.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会好的\N{\reng}It'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:58.54,1:54:59.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次不行了\N{\reng}Not this time, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:02.46,1:55:03.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别的时间线也许行\N{\reng}Maybe some other time.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:10.18,1:55:11.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们救不了你 是吗\N{\reng}We can't bring you back, can we?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:13.43,1:55:14.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已经救过了\N{\reng}You already did.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:16.81,1:55:18.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经救过了\N{\reng}You already did.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:29.03,1:55:30.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 巴里\N{\reng}Come on, Barry.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:31.16,1:55:32.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快起来啊 快啊\N{\reng}Gotta get up. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:32.78,1:55:33.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里\N{\reng}Barry.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.66,1:55:34.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再来一次\N{\reng}We go again.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:36.79,1:55:37.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里\N{\reng}Barry.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:40.21,1:55:41.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\reng}Let's just go.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:42.17,1:55:43.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里 好了 我们快走\N{\reng}Barry, come on. Let's just go.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.80,1:55:45.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里 这样做毫无意义\N{\reng}Barry, there's no point.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:48.05,1:55:49.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里\N{\reng}Barry!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.40,1:56:12.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,共振\N{\reng}Phase!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:16.58,1:56:17.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来 我帮你拔出来\N{\reng}Okay, I have to pull it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:18.54,1:56:19.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不用 我没事 - 我得把它拔出来\N{\reng}-I have to pull it out. -No, I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.54,1:56:21.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事 我应该早点儿停下的 巴里 用共振\N{\reng}You have to phase again. Barry, phase again. I'm okay. I just should've stopped sooner.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:39.48,1:56:40.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再来\N{\reng}Again.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:42.31,1:56:43.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里\N{\reng}Barry.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:51.57,1:56:53.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 我们能不能先停一下\N{\reng}Okay, can we please just take a minute?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:54.16,1:56:54.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 伙计\N{\reng}Sorry, dude.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:55.03,1:56:56.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兄弟 当然可以了\N{\reng}Yeah, bro, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:56.78,1:56:57.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我们的能力\N{\reng}That's the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:58.04,1:57:00.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想停多久 我们就能停多久\N{\reng}We can take as much time as it takes.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:00.29,1:57:01.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不是\N{\reng}No,
Dialogue: 0,1:57:01.16,1:57:02.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是那个意思 我\N{\reng}that's not what I mean. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:23.94,1:57:25.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样 好点儿了吗\N{\reng}Okay, you good?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:25.61,1:57:27.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧 我需要你帮忙\N{\reng}Come on. I need you in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:27.48,1:57:28.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快来吧\N{\reng}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:28.36,1:57:30.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里 拜托 先听我说\N{\reng}Barry, please, just listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:48.04,1:57:49.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去哪儿了\N{\reng}Where were you?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:49.21,1:57:51.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一直都站在这里没动吗\N{\reng}What, you just stand here the whole time?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:51.17,1:57:51.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里\N{\reng}Barry,
Dialogue: 0,1:57:52.17,1:57:54.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是一个无法避免的交汇点\N{\reng}this is an inevitable intersection.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:54.30,1:57:56.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点儿停手吧 巴里\N{\reng}You have to stop. Barry!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:11.32,1:58:12.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 巴里 等等\N{\reng}No, Barry, wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:18.66,1:58:19.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 巴里\N{\reng}Barry, listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:20.79,1:58:22.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有话要对你说\N{\reng}There's something I should tell you.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:24.96,1:58:26.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一开始尝试回到过去\N{\reng}I went back in time initially
Dialogue: 0,1:58:27.33,1:58:28.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是因为\N{\reng}because...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:28.29,1:58:29.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是因为妈妈死了\N{\reng}Yeah, because Mom died.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:30.21,1:58:31.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么知道\N{\reng}How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:31.55,1:58:32.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不重要\N{\reng}It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:32.80,1:58:33.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吗\N{\reng}Does it?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:34.34,1:58:36.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我必须纠正我犯下的错\N{\reng}You know that I have to undo what I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:37.18,1:58:37.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\reng}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:38.05,1:58:39.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没有做错\N{\reng}It's not a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:39.18,1:58:40.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能救她\N{\reng}We can save her.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:40.56,1:58:41.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也可以救他们\N{\reng}And we can save them.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:41.81,1:58:43.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们救不了\N{\reng}No, we can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:43.68,1:58:45.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是布鲁斯之前所说的\N{\reng}This is what Bruce was talking about.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:46.19,1:58:47.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里 这无法避免\N{\reng}Barry, this is inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:47.60,1:58:49.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就算尝试一百万次\N{\reng}We can try a million times,
Dialogue: 0,1:58:49.61,1:58:51.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也没办法改变这一切\N{\reng}and we're not gonna be able to fix this.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:51.73,1:58:53.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论我们做什么\N{\reng}No matter what we do...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:53.90,1:58:55.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世界都会灭亡\N{\reng}this world dies.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:56.65,1:58:57.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在今天\N{\reng}Today.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:58.70,1:58:59.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你自己看看\N{\reng}Look around.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:03.91,1:59:06.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们把这里搞得一团糟\N{\reng}Look at the damage we're causing.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:11.96,1:59:14.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在必须停手了 好吗\N{\reng}Now we have to stop. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:14.80,1:59:16.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 我本来只是回家洗衣服\N{\reng}Look, I was just doing my laundry.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:16.59,1:59:17.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你突然出现\N{\reng}You're the one who came
Dialogue: 0,1:59:17.72,1:59:19.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我说我是一个超级英雄\N{\reng}and told me that I'm a superhero.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:19.72,1:59:21.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在 你又是什么意思\N{\reng}And now you're saying what?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:21.68,1:59:23.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又不想让我当了\N{\reng}You don't want me to be?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:23.31,1:59:25.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思 现在太晚了\N{\reng}Well, guess what! It's too late!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:25.98,1:59:27.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是\N{\reng}I am...
Dialogue: 0,1:59:28.69,1:59:29.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闪电侠\N{\reng}...the Flash.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:30.19,1:59:31.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以拯救所有人\N{\reng}And I can save everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:32.23,1:59:33.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁都不会死\N{\reng}Nobody dies!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:33.69,1:59:34.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里\N{\reng}Barry...
Dialogue: 0,1:59:36.78,1:59:38.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有些问题注定无解\N{\reng}not every problem has a solution.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:47.33,1:59:49.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有些问题注定无解\N{\reng}Not every problem has a solution.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:53.67,1:59:54.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时我们只能放弃\N{\reng}Sometimes we just have to let go.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:54.96,1:59:57.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时候你只能放弃\N{\reng}Sometimes you just have to let go.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:57.42,1:59:58.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放弃\N{\reng}Let go
Dialogue: 0,1:59:58.84,1:59:59.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救妈妈\N{\reng}of Mom?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:00.22,2:00:03.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么多条时间线 总有一条妈妈会活着\N{\reng}She'll always be alive, somewhere in time.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:04.60,2:00:05.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定会\N{\reng}Always.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:06.43,2:00:07.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但不是这一条\N{\reng}Just not for us.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:08.69,2:00:10.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简直胡说八道\N{\reng}You're full of shit, dude.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:10.81,2:00:11.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要回去了\N{\reng}I'm going back.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:11.98,2:00:13.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要回去让妈妈死吗\N{\reng}You're going back to kill Mom?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:14.07,2:00:15.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行\N{\reng}No!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:15.44,2:00:16.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能走\N{\reng}You're staying!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:17.19,2:00:19.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别走 待在这儿\N{\reng}You stay, right here.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:20.66,2:00:22.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就让我再试一次\N{\reng}Just give me one more time.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:22.32,2:00:23.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里 站住\N{\reng}Barry, stop!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:24.03,2:00:25.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你站住\N{\reng}You, stop!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:58.07,2:00:59.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初次见面不太愉快\N{\reng}Feel like we got off on the wrong foot.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:00.15,2:01:01.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重新认识一下\N{\reng}Let's start again.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:01.53,2:01:02.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是闪电侠\N{\reng}I'm the Flash.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:02.91,2:01:04.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你叫什么\N{\reng}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:04.20,2:01:05.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的经历\N{\reng}I've lived...
Dialogue: 0,2:01:06.58,2:01:08.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超乎你的想象\N{\reng}more than you can dream.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:08.83,2:01:10.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,答非所问\N{\reng}Not an answer.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:11.08,2:01:13.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是在背台词吗\N{\reng}Do you, like, rehearse that?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:19.80,2:01:21.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快离开这儿 巴里\N{\reng}Get out of here, Barry!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:35.98,2:01:37.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个伤疤 你\N{\reng}That scar, you...
Dialogue: 0,2:01:38.94,2:01:40.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\reng}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:40.65,2:01:41.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是\N{\reng}So, you're...
Dialogue: 0,2:01:42.15,2:01:43.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是\N{\reng}You are...
Dialogue: 0,2:01:43.28,2:01:44.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 我就是\N{\reng}Yes, I am...
Dialogue: 0,2:01:45.41,2:01:46.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你\N{\reng}you.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:49.45,2:01:50.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上就成功了\N{\reng}We are so close.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:51.66,2:01:53.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就要弄清楚了\N{\reng}I've got it almost figured out.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:53.67,2:01:56.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这样做有多长时间了\N{\reng}How long have you been doing this?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:56.42,2:01:58.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多长时间并不重要\N{\reng}Time is inconsequential.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:59.17,2:02:00.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 巴里\N{\reng}Come on, Barry.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:09.56,2:02:11.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快看天上 有只鸟\N{\reng}Up in the sky! It's a bird!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:12.10,2:02:13.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是飞机\N{\reng}It's a plane!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:13.81,2:02:15.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是超人\N{\reng}It's Superman!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:57.35,2:02:59.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对万无一失\N{\reng}Purrfectly foolproof.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:00.57,2:03:02.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有小丑会这么想\N{\reng}Only the Joker would think of that.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:40.73,2:03:43.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看正在发生的这一切\N{\reng}Please just look at what's happening.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:44.19,2:03:45.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些世界\N{\reng}These worlds...
Dialogue: 0,2:03:54.54,2:03:56.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正在相互冲撞和崩毁\N{\reng}...they're colliding and collapsing.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:58.92,2:04:00.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这都怪我们\N{\reng}We did this.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:02.17,2:04:04.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们正在破坏万物的结构\N{\reng}W-We're destroying the fabric of everything.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:06.80,2:04:08.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你必须马上停手\N{\reng}You have to stop.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:08.09,2:04:10.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等我成功了 这些就都会停了\N{\reng}It stops once I've fixed it!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:12.68,2:04:15.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这也不全是你的错 巴里\N{\reng}It's not entirely your fault, Barry.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:15.72,2:04:18.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,9月29日那天 是我把你推出了时空之碗\N{\reng}I pushed you out of the Chronobowl on that September 29
Dialogue: 0,2:04:18.98,2:04:21.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让你帮我踏上了这条路\N{\reng}so you could start me on this path.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:22.48,2:04:24.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得我们这个悖论怎么样\N{\reng}How do you like our endless paradox?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:25.19,2:04:27.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我本人让你创造了我\N{\reng}I made you create me...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:28.28,2:04:29.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而现在你却成了\N{\reng}and now you're the one...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:31.03,2:04:32.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的阻碍\N{\reng}in my way.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:32.95,2:04:35.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论我多么接近打赢这场战斗\N{\reng}No matter how close I get to winning this fight...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:36.08,2:04:37.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你都会回去\N{\reng}you go back
Dialogue: 0,2:04:37.70,2:04:39.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,导致妈妈死去\N{\reng}and let Mom die.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:39.91,2:04:42.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你才是不可避免的交汇点\N{\reng}You're the inevitable intersection.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:43.04,2:04:44.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你确实需要放手\N{\reng}And you do have to let go.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:45.17,2:04:46.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是什么意思\N{\reng}What's he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:48.42,2:04:49.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是我的英雄\N{\reng}You're my hero.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:03.06,2:05:04.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这是干什么\N{\reng}What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:06.32,2:05:07.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别害怕 会愈合的\N{\reng}Hey, hey. Don't worry. It's gonna heal.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:07.94,2:05:08.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会愈合的\N{\reng}It's gonna heal.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:09.65,2:05:10.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚才是想\N{\reng}I just wanted to...
Dialogue: 0,2:05:28.55,2:05:30.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉妈妈我爱她\N{\reng}You tell Mom I love her.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:41.79,2:06:43.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别忘了这罐西红柿\N{\reng}Don't forget the tomatoes.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:56.30,2:06:58.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我小时候特别爱吃这种麦片\N{\reng}I used to love that cereal when I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:59.18,2:07:00.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吧\N{\reng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:00.93,2:07:02.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我儿子也特别喜欢吃\N{\reng}My son goes nuts for it.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:06.94,2:07:07.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惜要停产了\N{\reng}They stop making it.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:08.06,2:07:10.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听到消息说\N{\reng}Well, I know they were talking
Dialogue: 0,2:07:10.44,2:07:11.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种麦片就要停产了\N{\reng}about discontinuing it.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:11.48,2:07:12.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们认识吗\N{\reng}Do I know you?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:12.44,2:07:14.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我平时不住这附近\N{\reng}No, I'm not from around here.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:14.36,2:07:15.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是来看妈妈的\N{\reng}I was just visiting my mom.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:16.40,2:07:17.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没准我认识她\N{\reng}Maybe I know her.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:17.70,2:07:18.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她叫什么名字\N{\reng}What's her name?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:19.78,2:07:21.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是天底下最好\N{\reng}She's the best...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:22.66,2:07:24.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是最善良的人\N{\reng}and kindest person in the world.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:24.79,2:07:25.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\reng}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:25.66,2:07:26.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我就是\N{\reng}Yeah, I'm just...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:27.58,2:07:28.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会想她的\N{\reng}I'm really gonna miss her.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:50.06,2:07:53.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道 我只是超市里的一个陌生阿姨\N{\reng}I know I'm just... a random lady in a store.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:53.86,2:07:55.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我抱抱你吗\N{\reng}But do you want a hug?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:55.86,2:07:56.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\reng}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:03.03,2:08:04.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\reng}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:04.16,2:08:06.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要这么说\N{\reng}Oh, don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:07.46,2:08:10.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你特意来看妈妈 她一定特别感动\N{\reng}Your mom must be grateful you came to visit her.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:10.83,2:08:12.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有你是她的福气\N{\reng}She's very lucky to have you.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:20.22,2:08:21.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有她是我的福气\N{\reng}I'm very lucky to have her.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:23.35,2:08:25.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你可得亲口告诉她\N{\reng}You have to tell her that.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:25.93,2:08:27.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当妈妈的就喜欢听这样的话\N{\reng}Moms like to hear these kind of things.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:28.81,2:08:29.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信我吧\N{\reng}Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:09.06,2:09:10.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你 妈妈\N{\reng}Love you, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:18.11,2:09:19.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你更多\N{\reng}I love you more.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:21.53,2:09:23.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你更早\N{\reng}I loved you first.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:28.29,2:09:29.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见\N{\reng}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:29.54,2:09:30.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见\N{\reng}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:03.78,2:10:04.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来了\N{\reng}I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:15.42,2:10:16.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\reng}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:17.04,2:10:18.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,庭审\N{\reng}Court!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:27.93,2:10:30.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在此前的庭审中 被认定为\N{\reng}...original trial was initially...
Dialogue: 0,2:10:33.31,2:10:34.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常抱歉\N{\reng}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:38.82,2:10:40.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正如我刚才所说\N{\reng}As I was saying...
Dialogue: 0,2:10:41.11,2:10:44.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这条编号为F的录像证据在此前的庭审中\N{\reng}the same security camera footage, Exhibit F in the original trial,
Dialogue: 0,2:10:45.53,2:10:47.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被认定为无效证据\N{\reng}was initially considered useless,
Dialogue: 0,2:10:47.66,2:10:49.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是这一次\N{\reng}but has now
Dialogue: 0,2:10:49.33,2:10:53.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们借助韦恩企业的最新技术\N{\reng}been enhanced, using the latest tech
Dialogue: 0,2:10:53.33,2:10:55.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,提高了画面质量\N{\reng}from Wayne Enterprises.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:55.71,2:10:56.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,录像内容印证了\N{\reng}It confirms the alibi
Dialogue: 0,2:10:57.08,2:11:00.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾伦先生的不在场证明\N{\reng}Mr. Allen has argued,
Dialogue: 0,2:11:00.55,2:11:03.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也和他儿子 巴里\N{\reng}and his son, Barry,
Dialogue: 0,2:11:03.42,2:11:06.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当年的口供完全一致\N{\reng}has corroborated, since day one.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:12.18,2:11:13.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请看\N{\reng}Here.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:16.06,2:11:19.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家可以清楚地看到 被告人艾伦先生\N{\reng}Right here, you can clearly see my client, Mr. Allen,
Dialogue: 0,2:11:20.44,2:11:25.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正从货架最上层拿取西红柿罐头\N{\reng}reaching for a can of tomatoes on the top shelf.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:41.92,2:11:45.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾伦先生 您可以 再跟我们讲讲之前发生的事吗\N{\reng}Mr. Allen, Mr. Allen, can you tell us a bit more about what happened, please?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:45.55,2:11:46.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关于这个\N{\reng}Well, um...
Dialogue: 0,2:11:47.93,2:11:50.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西红柿从货架最底层移到了最上层\N{\reng}the tomatoes moved from the bottom shelf to the top shelf,
Dialogue: 0,2:11:50.43,2:11:51.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就导致了\N{\reng}and subsequently,
Dialogue: 0,2:11:51.80,2:11:54.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,煮熟的意面又变生了\N{\reng}uncooked the spaghetti.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:55.06,2:11:56.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说完了\N{\reng}Unquote.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:58.31,2:11:59.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 您刚刚说的是什么啊\N{\reng}I'm sorry, that makes absolutely no sense.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:59.98,2:12:01.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么意思 先生\N{\reng}What are you talking about, sir?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:01.23,2:12:02.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢大家\N{\reng}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:02.57,2:12:03.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常感谢各位\N{\reng}Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:04.11,2:12:06.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,采访结束了 谢谢\N{\reng}We're good here. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:08.53,2:12:09.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚才讲得还行吗\N{\reng}Did I give a good quote?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:09.82,2:12:11.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然 尤其是意面那句\N{\reng}Yeah. Spaghetti.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:12.83,2:12:15.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然说到了吃的 我在想\N{\reng}Hey, speaking of food, I was thinking, um...
Dialogue: 0,2:12:17.41,2:12:18.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该约我吃饭\N{\reng}you should ask me to dinner.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:19.67,2:12:20.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和我吃晚饭\N{\reng}D-Dinner with me?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:21.33,2:12:23.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 约会 巴里\N{\reng}Yes, a date, Barry.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:23.71,2:12:25.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾瑞斯 可以共进晚餐吗\N{\reng}Iris West, do you wanna dinner-date me?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:26.30,2:12:27.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很乐意\N{\reng}I'd love to.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:27.22,2:12:28.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\reng}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:28.68,2:12:29.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也很乐意\N{\reng}I'd love to also.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:30.68,2:12:31.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打给我\N{\reng}Call me.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:53.03,2:12:53.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布鲁斯\N{\reng}Bruce!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:53.91,2:12:54.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭喜啊\N{\reng}Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:54.83,2:12:55.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\reng}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:55.79,2:12:58.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可不知道我听见你的声音有多高兴\N{\reng}You have no idea how good it is to hear your voice.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:58.96,2:13:00.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等下次见了面 我有好多事要跟你讲\N{\reng}I... I have so much to tell you the next time I see you, Bruce.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:00.79,2:13:03.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说得对 是我没把你的话当真\N{\reng}You were right. Okay? And I didn't listen.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:03.17,2:13:04.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果事情发展得非常 非常离谱\N{\reng}And things did get very, very weird,
Dialogue: 0,2:13:05.04,2:13:07.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我把一切都恢复了 我向你保证\N{\reng}but I put everything back, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:07.30,2:13:08.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的车马上就到\N{\reng}I'm pulling up now.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:09.67,2:13:10.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\reng}Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:11.18,2:13:12.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先生 先生\N{\reng}Sir, sir!
Dialogue: 0,2:13:13.18,2:13:14.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先生 请您看镜头\N{\reng}- Back up, please. - Shot!
Dialogue: 0,2:13:20.31,2:13:22.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这和您受到的指控有关联吗\N{\reng}Was it backed by your own allegation?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:25.48,2:13:26.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见鬼了 这又是谁\N{\reng}Who the fuck is this?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:26.98,2:13:28.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 韦恩先生今天不接受采访\N{\reng}He's not answering any questions.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:29.69,2:13:30.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴里\N{\reng}Hey, Barry.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:31.82,2:13:33.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 那个谁呢\N{\reng}No, wh-where's...
Dialogue: 0,2:13:34.03,2:13:35.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是 你\N{\reng}You're, you...
Dialogue: 0,2:13:35.53,2:13:36.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 你不是\N{\reng}No. You can't...
Dialogue: 0,2:13:37.16,2:13:38.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你\N{\reng}You...
Dialogue: 0,2:13:38.16,2:13:39.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是蝙蝠侠啊\N{\reng}You're not Batman.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:42.21,2:13:43.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你失忆了吗\N{\reng}What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,2:22:36.53,2:22:38.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都说了我新陈代谢很快的\N{\reng}I've told you it's my metabolism, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:22:38.28,2:22:39.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是怎么都喝不醉的\N{\reng}I can't get drunk.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:40.04,2:22:41.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是喝不“坠”的\N{\reng}I can't get drink either.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:41.45,2:22:42.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着\N{\reng}Listen.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:42.54,2:22:43.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 我尽量\N{\reng}Listen, I'm,
Dialogue: 0,2:22:43.58,2:22:44.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 别喝了\N{\reng}'cause I'm trying to... No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:44.54,2:22:47.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我尽量用最简单的方式解释一下这是怎么回事\N{\reng}'Cause what I'm trying to explain as simply as I possibly can, I promise...
Dialogue: 0,2:22:47.17,2:22:48.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们都是蝙蝠侠\N{\reng}They were all Batman.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:48.29,2:22:49.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们都是布鲁斯·韦恩\N{\reng}They were all Bruce Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:49.71,2:22:51.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是他们各自又是完全不同的人\N{\reng}But each of them was a completely different person.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:51.71,2:22:53.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在另外一条线时间\N{\reng}So, on the other line-time...
Dialogue: 0,2:22:53.72,2:22:54.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时间线\N{\reng}Timeline.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:54.97,2:22:55.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还是同一个人\N{\reng}...I'm the same guy?
Dialogue: 0,2:22:56.05,2:22:57.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 基本上差不太多\N{\reng}Yeah. Actually, pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:57.80,2:22:59.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你招人喜欢 多毛\N{\reng}You're lovable, furry...
Dialogue: 0,2:22:59.47,2:23:01.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讲义气 超级爱吃培根\N{\reng}loyal, motivated by bacon.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:01.81,2:23:03.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 听着\N{\reng}All right, listen.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:03.31,2:23:05.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感谢你把情况简化以后再讲给我听\N{\reng}Thank you for making it more simpler for me,
Dialogue: 0,2:23:05.69,2:23:06.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简化先生\N{\reng}Mr. Simple More.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:06.56,2:23:07.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经尽力了\N{\reng}Yeah, I'm doing my best.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:07.94,2:23:10.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 你没听明白我要说的重点\N{\reng}Look, you're missing the larger premise here.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:10.23,2:23:12.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我的时间线\N{\reng}In my timeline,
Dialogue: 0,2:23:12.11,2:23:13.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当我\N{\reng}when I...
Dialogue: 0,2:23:14.90,2:23:16.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 来吧\N{\reng}All right, come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:16.91,2:23:18.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快起来 海王兄弟\N{\reng}Up, up, Broseidon.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:18.41,2:23:19.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行了 快起来\N{\reng}All right, come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:20.03,2:23:21.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是要睡沙发吗\N{\reng}I thought you were gonna sleep on the couch.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:22.91,2:23:24.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚瑟 我家就在这儿\N{\reng}Arthur, I live right here.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:24.21,2:23:25.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈里\N{\reng}Harry?
Dialogue: 0,2:23:26.42,2:23:28.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我家在这儿 没事的\N{\reng}I live right here. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:32.71,2:23:33.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\reng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:33.92,2:23:34.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了\N{\reng}Oh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:36.43,2:23:37.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再来几瓶啤酒\N{\reng}More beer.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:37.97,2:23:38.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去快回\N{\reng}Go fast.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:38.85,2:23:39.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等\N{\reng}Oh, here!
Dialogue: 0,2:23:39.72,2:23:40.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个\N{\reng}Here.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:40.72,2:23:41.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个\N{\reng}Here.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:42.68,2:23:43.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿这个换酒\N{\reng}Pay with this.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:44.56,2:23:46.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚瑟 这可是亚特兰蒂斯的珍宝\N{\reng}Arthur, this is Atlantean treasure.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:46.19,2:23:47.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这么跟他们说\N{\reng}You... You tell them that.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:48.56,2:23:51.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有钱买一身水手服\N{\reng}? Got no money For the sailor suit I... ?
Dialogue: 0,2:23:51.57,2:23:52.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 我是个水手\N{\reng}-Yep. -? I'm a sailor... ?
Dialogue: 0,2:23:53.07,2:23:54.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是水手\N{\reng}You're a sailor.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:54.82,2:23:55.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他没事\N{\reng}He's fine.

